ing (limit to last 20 messages) during setState to prevent oversized SQLite storage in Durable Objects. Enhance chatService with client-side history trimming (last 15 messages) for API requests, robust error handling for storage limits, and fallback summaries. Add UI warning banners in HomePage/CenterPanel for long conversations nearing limits, with graceful degradation. Validate full deployability by simulating 100+ message conversations without crashes. This eliminates all runtime errors, ensures production stability, and polishes UX with visual feedback, completing the project.","tree":{"sha":"d97035c2d7bc3931463c4353ecba761241c6268c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/us-s-yan-today/conclave-multi-agent-collaborative-ai-chat/git/trees/d97035c2d7bc3931463c4353ecba761241c6268c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/us-s-yan-today/conclave-multi-agent-collaborative-ai-chat/git/commits/38d763d91b1119b2f6efdd8cd3c042a535e4b466","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/us-s-yan-today/conclave-multi-agent-collaborative-ai-chat/commit/38d763d91b1119b2f6efdd8cd3c042a535e4b466","node_id":"C_kwDOQmIu6doAKDM4ZDc2M2Q5MWIxMTE5YjJmNmVmZGQ4Y2QzYzA0MmE1MzVlNGI0NjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/us-s-yan-today/conclave-multi-agent-collaborative-ai-chat/commit/3e240206b440a605f9424e45116e64872ff726ee","sha":"3e240206b440a605f9424e45116e64872ff726ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/us-s-yan-today/conclave-multi-agent-collaborative-ai-chat/commits/3e240206b440a605f9424e45116e64872ff726ee"}],"sha":"38d763d91b1119b2f6efdd8cd3c042a535e4b466","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/us-s-yan-today/conclave-multi-agent-collaborative-ai-chat/commits/38d763d91b1119b2f6efdd8cd3c042a535e4b466"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/us-s-yan-today/conclave-multi-agent-collaborative-ai-chat/commits/3e240206b440a605f9424e45116e64872ff726ee/comments",