90f325a6fda","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearmerch.com/commits/34d0e52444fea2ac408fdc8a04a1d90f325a6fda"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/150408924?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MisbahAnsar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MisbahAnsar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MisbahAnsar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MisbahAnsar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MisbahAnsar","id":150408924,"login":"MisbahAnsar","node_id":"U_kgDOCPcO3A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MisbahAnsar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MisbahAnsar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MisbahAnsar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MisbahAnsar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MisbahAnsar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MisbahAnsar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearmerch.com/commits/fe67c8a9939aad93c9d469af1e79c3fc26ff3acd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T17:03:14Z","email":"150408924+MisbahAnsar@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Misbah Ansari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T17:03:14Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: add DB-backed maintenance mode for the storefront (#224)\n\n* feat: add DB-backed maintenance mode for the storefront\n\nAllow admins to pause purchases at runtime with a banner, disabled checkout, and API-side createCheckout blocking.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix: keep checkout available if maintenance settings cannot be read\n\nAvoid taking the store down when the site_settings table is missing or the stored payload is invalid; only block purchases when maintenance is confirmed on.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* refactor: match issue 223 maintenance mode scope\n\nKeep the DB toggle, banner, purchase blocking, and admin control from the ticket, and drop extra polling, custom-message UI, and fail-open behavior.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix: address review findings for maintenance mode\n\n- Fail open when maintenance settings cannot be read: createCheckout no\n  longer blocks on a config read error, and getSiteConfig reports defaults\n  instead of a 500\n- Wire the maintenance message end to end: admin dashboard gains a banner\n  message input, and MaintenanceBanner renders the stored message with a\n  fallback\n- Make setMaintenanceMode a single atomic upsert (no read-modify-write\n  race); empty message clears, omitted message preserves\n- Declare FORBIDDEN (not just UNAUTHORIZED) on setMaintenanceMode contract\n- Merge maintenance state into the existing cart disabled-button branch\n- Drop redundant SiteConfigSchema/SiteConfig alias\n- Bump changeset to minor\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: Elliot Braem <elliot@ejlbraem.com>","tree":{"sha":"9e2a343f16f1d631aaf4d55dc4e5763c64a6d9c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearmerch.com/git/trees/9e2a343f16f1d631aaf4d55dc4e5763c64a6d9c0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearmerch.com/git/commits/fe67c8a9939aad93c9d469af1e79c3fc26ff3acd","verification":{"payload":"tree 9e2a343f16f1d631aaf4d55dc4e5763c64a6d9c0\nparent b298ebdf15cc3939c869727ee6ae2d20d300bfba\nauthor Misbah Ansari <150408924+MisbahAnsar@users.noreply.github.com> 1791306194 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791306194 -0500\n\nfeat: add DB-backed maintenance mode for the storefront (#224)\n\n* feat: add DB-backed maintenance mode for the storefront\n\nAllow admins to pause purchases at runtime with a banner, disabled checkout, and API-side createCheckout blocking.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix: keep checkout available if maintenance settings cannot be read\n\nAvoid taking the store down when the site_settings table is missing or the stored payload is invalid; only block purchases when maintenance is confirmed on.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* refactor: match issue 223 maintenance mode scope\n\nKeep the DB toggle, banner, purchase blocking, and admin control from the ticket, and drop extra polling, custom-message UI, and fail-open behavior.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix: address review findings for maintenance mode\n\n- Fail open when maintenance settings cannot be read: createCheckout no\n  longer blocks on a config read error, and getSiteConfig reports defaults\n  instead of a 500\n- Wire the maintenance message end to end: admin dashboard gains a banner\n  message input, and MaintenanceBanner renders the stored message with a\n  fallback\n- Make setMaintenanceMode a single atomic upsert (no read-modify-write\n  race); empty message clears, omitted message preserves\n- Declare FORBIDDEN (not just UNAUTHORIZED) on setMaintenanceMode contract\n- Merge maintenance state into the existing cart disabled-button branch\n- Drop redundant SiteConfigSchema/SiteConfig alias\n- Bump changeset to minor\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: Elliot Braem <elliot@ejlbraem.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxSnSCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAqEwQAFAfDHQ7nz7rJiLtRfSFM6Ic\nVJnjk0Ijssj5HSTd0fVyU4bHIJgGajxyRpTIpVDhU/lwQ4sKIw0DpKLtgjWT6Ah5\nmbYYOCp+7zgQ3bc4WLG9vRlWbbduIpAfKd7Ae/BKtUlAXrhBpSMkMG+wALmW8SDo\nAinTW1r4P5e8gtsKvEQag0wdi/HI99ffqDTHc1ruqxw1+cCVwOEyHOGOFTRGe3fG\njZ+xhhGX/Bj/+JWuMh5PJQWvkDIAom6slCxLch66XCl4POFQEu8PC6njewrt416B\nPZn0+N92ehzttZHcpLiwEBxwzZbk5t56spMjAMcO47ldEsp+vF5riAvs70KbgFug\nHTsem3HFjR/5FV3BgxbfjG6JMLl2uTI9GwFHxcBiEe2GqwKBSOjvgeTtXIx6Ffh9\nOD2FMTJ4TBiZ1+IlHRpfnVirNHuK1WfNIYdVdV3i/3u