RBuilders/nearmerch.com/commits/a97de6221a61b23364eb9857fd50ab02facf9a70"}],"sha":"d456516dd46897a97525e1789b506b8967ce8988","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearmerch.com/commits/d456516dd46897a97525e1789b506b8967ce8988"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16282460?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/elliotBraem","id":16282460,"login":"elliotBraem","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjgyNDYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearmerch.com/commits/a97de6221a61b23364eb9857fd50ab02facf9a70/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T06:19:43Z","email":"elliot@ejlbraem.com","name":"Elliot Braem"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T06:19:43Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Adds basic provider for email (#163)\n\n* basic provider\n\n* refactor: redesign new-product flow for basic fulfillment support\n\nRedesign the create product flow from a 5-step wizard to a 2-step\nprovider → builder approach that adapts based on provider type.\n\nFor Basic (manual) fulfillment:\n- No catalog step (manual provider has no catalog)\n- Single scrollable form: details, images, pricing, variants,\n  and notification emails\n- Images: upload/URL, reorder, set thumbnail; post-creation\n  updateProduct call for proper ProductImage types\n- Pricing: required price field (no catalog default)\n- Variants: defaults to single ''Default'' variant, add more optionally\n- Per-product notification emails via metadata.providerDetails.manual\n- Provider config email info links to /dashboard/providers\n\nFor Printful/Lulu (catalog providers):\n- Catalog selection, variants, design assets, details — all on\n  one scrollable page with progressive disclosure\n- Sections appear after dependencies are met (variants after\n  catalog product, design after variants)\n\nShared infrastructure extracted:\n- ui/src/lib/providers.ts: PROVIDERS constant, PROVIDER_MAP,\n  ProviderName type — reusable across dashboard\n- ui/src/hooks/use-file-upload.ts: useFileUpload hook replacing\n  3x duplicated presigned-upload logic\n- ui/src/components/ui/tag-input.tsx: TagInput component replacing\n  duplicated badge-based email/account tag UI\n\nCode quality fixes:\n- Remove @ts-nocheck — fully typed\n- Replace 18 individual useState calls with single FormState object\n- Fix stale closures in file upload handlers (functional updates)\n- Fix handleBuildManual null-product error handling\n- Fix image type assignment (thumbnail=primary, others=detail)\n- Fix variantRef collision (crypto.randomUUID vs Date.now)\n- Fix v.price?.retail type error (now v.price?.cost)\n- Fix useCatalogProduct missing { enabled } option\n- BasicNotificationsSection uses useNavigate() hook directly\n  instead of receiving navigate as a prop\n- Compute PROVIDER_MAP.get() once instead of repeated .find()\n\n* resolve\n\n* update pr\n\n* fix test","tree":{"sha":"e90167829e1f32532d2b3c6157d9683a8a3eb30b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearmerch.com/git/trees/e90167829e1f32532d2b3c6157d9683a8a3eb30b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearmerch.com/git/commits/a97de6221a61b23364eb9857fd50ab02facf9a70","verification":{"payload":"tree e90167829e1f32532d2b3c6157d9683a8a3eb30b\nparent 0c500570736683e09a69b026240709e9b984bd7b\nauthor Elliot Braem <elliot@ejlbraem.com> 1780553983 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780553983 -0500\n\nAdds basic provider for email (#163)\n\n* basic provider\n\n* refactor: redesign new-product flow for basic fulfillment support\n\nRedesign the create product flow from a 5-step wizard to a 2-step\nprovider → builder approach that adapts based on provider type.\n\nFor Basic (manual) fulfillment:\n- No catalog step (manual provider has no catalog)\n- Single scrollable form: details, images, pricing, variants,\n  and notification emails\n- Images: upload/URL, reorder, set thumbnail; post-creation\n  updateProduct call for proper ProductImage types\n- Pricing: required price field (no catalog default)\n- Variants: defaults to single ''Default'' variant, add more optionally\n- Per-product notification emails via metadata.providerDetails.manual\n- Provider config email info links to /dashboard/providers\n\nFor Printful/Lulu (catalog providers):\n- Catalog selection, variants, design assets, details — all on\n  one scrollable page with progressive disclosure\n- Sections appear after dependencies are met (variants after\n  catalog product, design after variants)\n\nShared infrastructure extracted:\n- ui/src/lib/providers.ts: PROVIDERS constant, PROVIDER_MAP,\n  ProviderName type — reusable across dashboard\n- ui/src/hooks/use-file-upload.ts: useFileUpload hook replacing\n  3x duplicated presigned-upload logic\n- ui/src/components/ui/tag-input.tsx: TagInput component replacing\n  duplicated badge-based email/account tag UI\n\nCode quality fixes:\n- Remove @ts-nocheck — fully typed\n- Replace 18 individual useState calls with single FormState object\n- Fix stale closures in file upload handlers (functional updates)\n- Fix handleBuildManual null-product error handling\n- Fix image type assignment (thumbnail=primary, others=detail)\n- Fix variantRef collision (crypto.randomUUID vs Date.now)\n- Fix v.price?.retail type error (now v.price?.cost)\n- Fix useCatalogProduct missing { enabled } option\n- BasicNotificationsSection uses useNavigate() hook directly\n  instead of receiving navigate as a prop\n- Compute PROVIDER_MAP.get() once instead of repeated .find()\n\n* resolve\n\n* update pr\n\n* fix test","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqIRj/CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAADZIQACMVksOS1U+8FDbm3rCy4lnX\n0ua+kywR4r3/RNX8rS/a9kekqR09g00yCX+iYIR4mbgkVfoFKqwweSqG1CASPNxb\nAy1VJf0zdK5TYNpSVKPxfH61U74OUvczTxrkdRvFzp9sQ3zHjxyiEENDtIvwwSRD\nkBLYzVUdFZ3zS4vp0luLZe+5pxpdqe6hJoO41Z7/+VvcSPw/bm9OZUISUoZKBMXh\nDFmB5GrJ3hFhiWrqYqdOPapgBC5C8sEZnBP1qe1sAAqiPgrUufmBGeCPdXucD2gz\nVDBbl8IxOIVrv+ywx2beZZRjgLsJsI3Bgz3aHo0hFz8Z04FeKnHiAmRf7PsPWdIw\n54rj1lDeKh1jYi2W+5FamRp3K3GaoSFQV93VvxKc1vx9EUl0RdfNWDNTiWBhGdb4\nOgKkREGyYly6/QZi7nRa4myEG5IskdMbNhbnA24T9YV+GFtHB7JPRQFo4vigS3Xb\nluSCJHbW3Ou4D4Mc9PI6JElJNfM5kG2+XRgTpnEn6vwvWyDU/AIaruiyFuVCztXA\n+xFVj/38ExlBgJEWBpvHbprogKobXReG2acdPlePO1QZGQnxMANgq6IxB4SawZZl\nhsPCzidhK8F/Srg9X4s9vDNYbi5Rm/UIpfka1Y+Cv1wgQ+wEF56n/8aYNZtiGPvn\nc3+dFPMFKoeONw3oZpwQ\n=9AOv\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-04T06:19:44Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.git