omment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-05T04:25:05Z","email":"elliot@ejlbraem.com","name":"Elliot Braem"},"message":"changeset","tree":{"sha":"dca949f5e1fe7d0c9dd7d52a094228c073a9b75d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearmerch.com/git/trees/dca949f5e1fe7d0c9dd7d52a094228c073a9b75d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearmerch.com/git/commits/fd43e99c17c7951befac238629523243978e66e7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16282460?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/elliotBraem","id":16282460,"login":"elliotBraem","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjgyNDYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NEARBuilders/nearmerch.com/commit/fd43e99c17c7951befac238629523243978e66e7","node_id":"C_kwDOQmYkR9oAKGZkNDNlOTljMTdjNzk1MWJlZmFjMjM4NjI5NTIzMjQzOTc4ZTY2ZTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NEARBuilders/nearmerch.com/commit/b64da5a9eae497bf679e3538d285cea8d990667e","sha":"b64da5a9eae497bf679e3538d285cea8d990667e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearmerch.com/commits/b64da5a9eae497bf679e3538d285cea8d990667e"}],"sha":"fd43e99c17c7951befac238629523243978e66e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearmerch.com/commits/fd43e99c17c7951befac238629523243978e66e7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16282460?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/elliotBraem","id":16282460,"login":"elliotBraem","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjgyNDYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearmerch.com/commits/b64da5a9eae497bf679e3538d285cea8d990667e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-05T04:03:08Z","email":"elliot@ejlbraem.com","name":"Elliot Braem"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-05T04:03:08Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Fix Printful orders created without designs and draft confirmation failures (#156)\n\n* Fix Printful orders created without designs and draft confirmation failures\n\nWhen getCatalogProduct() fails during sync (rate limits, network errors),\nFulfillmentFile records end up without technique metadata. At order creation,\nfiles without technique were silently filtered out, producing blank-product\norders with no placements. Additionally, when confirmOrder() fails because\nPrintful costs are still calculating, the order stays in\npaid_pending_fulfillment with nothing to retry the confirmation.\n\n- Resolve missing techniques at order time by fetching catalog product from\n  Printful API and mapping slot→technique from its placements data\n- Throw FulfillmentError if no valid placements after resolution (no silent\n  blank orders)\n- Default slot to ''default'' when undefined on files\n- Add shouldRetryConfirmation to Printful webhook for order_updated+draft\n  when order is paid_pending_fulfillment\n- Detect cost-calculation-pending errors in PingPay webhook with clear logging\n- Add retry-confirmation cron job (POST /cron/retry-confirmations) as safety\n  net for stuck orders\n- Add findPendingConfirmation to OrderStore\n- Improve logging throughout sync and order creation pipeline\n\n* Add fulfillment cost visibility, price locking, and fix V2 pricing\n\nFix Printful V2 pricing: getVariantPrice/getProductPrices now correctly\nparse variant.techniques[].price and product.placements[].price instead\nof non-existent wholesale_price/retail_price fields. Fulfillment cost\nis now computed as technique price + additional placement costs.\n\n- Add priceLocked flag to products DB schema and admin API\n- Add fulfillmentCost to variant providerConfig and API responses\n- Add cost/margin columns to inventory table, cost card to product edit\n- Add price lock toggle to product edit sheet\n- Handle catalog_price_changed webhook by re-syncing pricing\n- Add findByExternalProductId to ProductStore\n- Fix 0010_snapshot.json migration chain collision\n- Generate 0011 migration for price_locked column\n- Extract TechniquePrice/PlacementPrice/VariantPricing/PrintfulProviderConfig types\n- Parallelize getVariantPricesBatch with Effect.forEach (concurrency: 5)\n- Rename wholesale/retail to cost/discountedCost in ProviderCatalogPriceSchema\n- Remove unsafe  casts in store and UI\n\n* bun lock","tree":{"sha":"926d676ab23e2335b98d260dafd5a07571792626","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearmerch.com/git/trees/926d676ab23e2335b98d260dafd5a07571792626"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearmerch.com/git/commits/b64da5a9eae497bf679e3538d285cea8d990667e","verification":{"payload":"tree 926d676ab23e2335b98d260dafd5a07571792626\nparent e88f62d0e8cb5438163d117beee3871e882977ef\nauthor Elliot Braem <elliot@ejlbraem.com> 1777953788 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1777953788 -0500\n\nFix Printful orders created without designs and draft confirmation failures (#156)\n\n* Fix Printful orders created without designs and draft confirmation failures\n\nWhen getCatalogProduct() fails during sync (rate limits, network errors),\nFulfillmentFile records end up without technique metadata. At order creation,\nfiles without technique were silently filtered out, producing blank-product\norders with no placements. Additionally, when confirmOrder() fails because\nPrintful costs are still calculating, the order stays in\npaid_pending_fulfillment with nothing to retry the confirmation.\n\n- Resolve missing techniques at order time by fetching catalog product from\n  Printful API and mapping slot→technique from its placements data\n- Throw FulfillmentError if no valid placements after resolution (no silent\n  blank orders)\n- Default slot to ''default'' when undefined on files\n- Add shouldRetryConfirmation to Printful webhook for order_updated+draft\n  when order is paid_pending_fulfillment\n- Detect cost-calculation-pending errors in PingPay webhook with clear logging\n- Add retry-confirmation cron job (POST /cron/retry-confirmations) as safety\n  net for stuck orders\n- Add findPendingConfirmation to OrderStore\n- Improve logging throughout sync and order creation pipeline\n\n* Add fulfillment cost visibility, price locking, and fix V2 pricing\n\nFix Printful V2 pricing: getVariantPrice/getProductPrices now correctly\nparse variant.techniques[].price and product.placements[].price instead\nof non-existent wholesale_price/retail_price fields. Fulfillment cost\nis now computed as technique price + additional placement costs.\n\n- Add priceLocked flag to products DB schema and admin API\n- Add fulfillmentCost to variant providerConfig and API responses\n- Add cost/margin columns to inventory table, cost card to product edit\n- Add price lock toggle to product edit sheet\n- Handle catalog_price_changed webhook by re-syncing pricing\n- Add findByExternalProductId to ProductStore\n- Fix 0010_snapshot.json migration chain collision\n- Generate 0011 migration for price_locked column\n- Extract TechniquePrice/PlacementPrice/VariantPricing/PrintfulProviderConfig types\n- Parallelize getVariantPricesBatch with Effect.forEach (concurrency: 5)\n- Rename wholesale/retail to cost/discountedCost in ProviderCatalogPriceSchema\n- Remove unsafe  casts in store and UI\n\n* bun lock","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp+Wv8CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAbvwQAG0n/bmlcKvOSGfLsydbY4tb\nL9FjDL7ni9njW9cjD7f+6jXvwj31xsqu+hoMrsAtg8n58hutk1Lb+TQRum2ZanJZ\ns6pj9lUjoId52BqRzzJXeMSsshAyC5gGwute7HgZVSDoZQBQXaMRVRMB3DaMJRma\nVrH53ksEdJTd/tAIyGp/kSjAZ+MvEydR1UsTHFr/aOFUoMlOCWWxOoxAA8dgPGFZ\n4G7MuEsRadcCPjNobFCCzJUf7BP88QjNat6QS/BTGGIBnLAFBs4MGqbASWShNp7x\n2LYxIO40jKiKqsz+7kC7gip0F7t1ZoTlOAXkp1GoCu32SZL6RhF6cfXbMGqROYSc\nbFJ5vIEDuE/EIxdGyjxZ7RxYOPEKBR30T9SpMbSv5Qh7EO05Yu4+TcxNTRWlx56k\n2qb2U7W+gtx0gV0qi9HsFvCTrs+TWfHH19sP9LmD0RjutuRniq1NfPnXVX9uL9Zy\n53iXof/hTzL/VG+cXhTOc4FP9Sw7/G6UeVkb1BskfsTjcVM807YSmirpzXgtTlT9\nnA6xC316bOg3MRJ8Bc6vX0n3cFSXaI8zmz0YKs9uK6y9chOvKr83vcA2Xs17guFE\nLl18mHOprkrhvBETLtPTGQGG1jIz9JHvQWalC7/SvHM6ECReMU2+xjwsdZMEkvSo\nELFuCl5VPPl+eJQZu8//\n=BdbA\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-05T04:03:08Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users