026-10-03T20:47:03Z","email":"123564022+0xNiel@users.noreply.github.com","name":"0xNiel"},"message":"docs: flatten the architecture diagram so every renderer draws it\n\nThe Terminal manager -> Toolbox pods edge went from a node in a nested\nsubgraph (platform-manager inside Kubernetes cluster) to the outer\nsubgraph. Some Mermaid renderers drew that edge in the inner\nsubgraph''s coordinates, leaving an orphaned arrow. Make the binary and\nthe cluster resources sibling subgraphs and write one edge per line\ninstead of the & shorthand. Checked with Mermaid 11 (dagre), the\nmarkdown-mermaid extension''s bundle, and the ELK layout.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6ec1d2d9c449d33bcc2c6cc4c9392a61dc66bf7c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/git/trees/6ec1d2d9c449d33bcc2c6cc4c9392a61dc66bf7c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/git/commits/6f440d3e0b4c66417274996a4577a15f66760ea1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123564022?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0xNiel","id":123564022,"login":"0xNiel","node_id":"U_kgDOB11v9g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/0xNiel/platform-manager/commit/6f440d3e0b4c66417274996a4577a15f66760ea1","node_id":"C_kwDOQmgX-toAKDZmNDQwZDNlMGI0YzY2NDE3Mjc0OTk2YTQ1NzdhMTVmNjY3NjBlYTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/0xNiel/platform-manager/commit/8d5760263e5299a51018b67572b0d38371f9424c","sha":"8d5760263e5299a51018b67572b0d38371f9424c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/commits/8d5760263e5299a51018b67572b0d38371f9424c"}],"sha":"6f440d3e0b4c66417274996a4577a15f66760ea1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/commits/6f440d3e0b4c66417274996a4577a15f66760ea1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123564022?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0xNiel","id":123564022,"login":"0xNiel","node_id":"U_kgDOB11v9g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/commits/8d5760263e5299a51018b67572b0d38371f9424c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T19:28:43Z","email":"123564022+0xNiel@users.noreply.github.com","name":"0xNiel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T19:28:43Z","email":"123564022+0xNiel@users.noreply.github.com","name":"0xNiel"},"message":"docs: add screenshots and fix the architecture diagram\n\nAdd six screenshots from the platform-up demo: the dashboard under the\nintro and the other views in a new Screenshots section.\n\nThe Toolbox pods node had the ID TB, which is a Mermaid direction\nkeyword (top-to-bottom). Some renderers took the TM --> TB edge as a\ndirection and drew it as an orphaned arrow. Rename it to TOOLBOX in\nthe README and in the security doc''s diagram.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4fe6b6fd5510fe81b66f34fa9421f3604cc584bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/git/trees/4fe6b6fd5510fe81b66f34fa9421f3604cc584bb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/git/commits/8d5760263e5299a51018b67572b0d38371f9424c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123564022?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0xNiel","id":123564022,"login":"0xNiel","node_id":"U_kgDOB11v9g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/0xNiel/platform-manager/commit/8d5760263e5299a51018b67572b0d38371f9424c","node_id":"C_kwDOQmgX-toAKDhkNTc2MDI2M2U1Mjk5YTUxMDE4YjY3NTcyYjBkMzgzNzFmOTQyNGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/0xNiel/platform-manager/commit/05b147afc00ac234667316463e24d1047b942afd","sha":"05b147afc00ac234667316463e24d1047b942afd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/commits/05b147afc00ac234667316463e24d1047b942afd"}],"sha":"8d5760263e5299a51018b67572b0d38371f9424c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/commits/8d5760263e5299a51018b67572b0d38371f9424c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123564022?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0xNiel","id":123564022,"login":"0xNiel","node_id":"U_kgDOB11v9g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/commits/05b147afc00ac234667316463e24d1047b942afd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T19:27:31Z","email":"123564022+0xNiel@users.noreply.github.com","name":"0xNiel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T19:27:31Z","email":"123564022+0xNiel@users.noreply.github.com","name":"0xNiel"},"message":"fix(rules): measure ResourceSummary staleness from lastSeen\n\nStaleResourceRule read status.lastSeen but computed age from the\ncreation timestamp, so every summary older than an hour was flagged\nstale even though the scanner refreshes it every 30 seconds. The rule\nnever ran before the evaluator was fixed to list ResourceSummaries\nunder the right group; once it did, a long-running demo showed 22\nfalse medium findings.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b756462745f9c5684df8864afe01baba76ba1cc2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/git/trees/b756462745f9c5684df8864afe01baba76ba1cc2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/git/commits/05b147afc00ac234667316463e24d1047b942afd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123564022?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0xNiel","id":123564022,"login":"0xNiel","node_id":"U_kgDOB11v9g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/0xNiel/platform-manager/commit/05b147afc00ac234667316463e24d1047b942afd","node_id":"C_kwDOQmgX-toAKDA1YjE0N2FmYzAwYWMyMzQ2NjczMTY0NjNlMjRkMTA0N2I5NDJhZmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/0xNiel/platform-manager/commit/4dfb1ebdcffa8d7ad9250aed5a766c72a7c0e04f","sha":"4dfb1ebdcffa8d7ad9250aed5a766c72a7c0e04f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/commits/4dfb1ebdcffa8d7ad9250aed5a766c72a7c0e04f"}],"sha":"05b147afc00ac234667316463e24d1047b942afd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/commits/05b147afc00ac234667316463e24d1047b942afd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123564022?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0xNiel","id":123564022,"login":"0xNiel","node_id":"U_kgDOB11v9g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/commits/4dfb1ebdcffa8d7ad9250aed5a766c72a7c0e04f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T02:52:46Z","email":"123564022+0xNiel@users.noreply.github.com","name":"0xNiel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T02:52:46Z","email":"123564022+0xNiel@users.noreply.github.com","name":"0xNiel"},"message":"feat(dev): one-command demo with make platform-up / platform-down\n\nhack/platform.sh builds the whole demo: kind cluster, LocalStack,\nArgoCD, Crossplane with the IAM, S3, and DynamoDB providers, and\nPrometheus. It seeds three tenants with healthy and broken resources,\ncreates IAM drift directly in LocalStack, and starts the API and UI.\nIt is idempotent, uses its own kubeconfig in .platform/ so the user''s\nkubectl context is never touched, and checks ports before starting.\n\nTargets: platform-up, platform-stop, platform-down, platform-status.\n\nSeed fixes found while testing it from scratch:\n- ProviderConfig: s3_use_path_style, so buckets resolve against\n  LocalStack instead of bucket.host.docker.internal.\n- Composition: %[1]s in the policy template (three %s with one input\n  produced %!s(MISSING)), quote the DynamoDB attribute type \"N\"\n  (YAML 1.1 reads it as false), and label composed resources with the\n  tenant.\n- Busy-loop stand-ins for the training and ETL workloads, CPU-capped,\n  so the CPU metrics show real usage.\n- A Crossplane role pointing at a missing ProviderConfig, so the demo\n  has a real reconcile failure.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3b8bf0cf040a6d0ae2b93e15edf17e1374dc5621","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/git/trees/3b8bf0cf040a6d0ae2b93e15edf17e1374dc5621"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/git/commits/4dfb1ebdcffa8d7ad9250aed5a766c72a7c0e04f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123564022?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0xNiel","id":123564022,"login":"0xNiel","node_id":"U_kgDOB11v9g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/0xNiel/platform-manager/commit/4dfb1ebdcffa8d7ad9250aed5a766c72a7c0e04f","node_id":"C_kwDOQmgX-toAKDRkZmIxZWJkY2ZmYThkN2FkOTI1MGFlZDVhNzY2YzcyYTdjMGUwNGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/0xNiel/platform-manager/commit/fe1ffb67552628b2c4eb1caa555fd992a1bbbda4","sha":"fe1ffb67552628b2c4eb1caa555fd992a1bbbda4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/commits/fe1ffb67552628b2c4eb1caa555fd992a1bbbda4"}],"sha":"4dfb1ebdcffa8d7ad9250aed5a766c72a7c0e04f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/commits/4dfb1ebdcffa8d7ad9250aed5a766c72a7c0e04f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123564022?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0xNiel","id":123564022,"login":"0xNiel","node_id":"U_kgDOB11v9g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/commits/fe1ffb67552628b2c4eb1caa555fd992a1bbbda4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T02:52:36Z","email":"123564022+0xNiel@users.noreply.github.com","name":"0xNiel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T02:52:36Z","email":"123564022+0xNiel@users.noreply.github.com","name":"0xNiel"},"message":"fix: count Crossplane resources the way tenants actually label them\n\n- Crossplane watcher and resource scanner only matched a tenant''s\n  labelSelector, but managed resources are labeled with the tenant''s\n  name (the key the IAM drift scanner uses), so every tenant showed 0\n  Crossplane resources. Share one belongsToTenant rule that accepts the\n  tenant-name label, the labelSelector, or the tenant''s namespaces.\n- Track S3 Buckets and DynamoDB Tables, not just IAM kinds.\n- Treat Synced=False/ReconcileError as Failed. Ready stays at Creating\n  when a reconcile errors, so broken resources showed as Waiting.\n- Count XRs and claims for every CompositeResourceDefinition instead of\n  one hardcoded TenantIAMBundle kind.\n- The rule evaluator listed ResourceSummaries under platform.io instead\n  of platform.platform.io and skipped them.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c67a7f1313cf18d9cade92ad74e3064c7e831908","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/git/trees/c67a7f1313cf18d9cade92ad74e3064c7e831908"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/git/commits/fe1ffb67552628b2c4eb1caa555fd992a1bbbda4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123564022?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0xNiel","id":123564022,"login":"0xNiel","node_id":"U_kgDOB11v9g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/0xNiel/platform-manager/commit/fe1ffb67552628b2c4eb1caa555fd992a1bbbda4","node_id":"C_kwDOQmgX-toAKGZlMWZmYjY3NTUyNjI4YjJjNGViMWNhYTU1NWZkOTkyYTFiYmJkYTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/0xNiel/platform-manager/commit/f33f0f81344acc1518120e48633efef212db5849","sha":"f33f0f81344acc1518120e48633efef212db5849","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/commits/f33f0f81344acc1518120e48633efef212db5849"}],"sha":"fe1ffb67552628b2c4eb1caa555fd992a1bbbda4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/commits/fe1ffb67552628b2c4eb1caa555fd992a1bbbda4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123564022?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0xNiel","id":123564022,"login":"0xNiel","node_id":"U_kgDOB11v9g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/commits/f33f0f81344acc1518120e48633efef212db5849/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T02:06:54Z","email":"123564022+0xNiel@users.noreply.github.com","name":"0xNiel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T02:06:54Z","email":"123564022+0xNiel@users.noreply.github.com","name":"0xNiel"},"message":"fix(web): make the UI reach the API from a browser\n\nEvery page showed \"Network Error\" or empty zeros in a browser:\n\n- The UI sends X-Dev-Role in development, but the CORS preflight did\n  not allow that header, so browsers blocked every request. curl was\n  unaffected because it skips preflight. In dev mode, allow X-Dev-Role\n  and echo the request origin instead of \"*\", which browsers reject\n  together with Allow-Credentials. Production CORS is unchanged.\n- Five views called http://localhost:9080 directly with plain axios or\n  fetch, bypassing VUE_APP_API_URL and the dev role header. Route them\n  through the shared API client.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c28a8a63134dc7f0965b3a5b7fec135fdfed5e2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/git/trees/c28a8a63134dc7f0965b3a5b7fec135fdfed5e2e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/git/commits/f33f0f81344acc1518120e48633efef212db5849","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123564022?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0xNiel","id":123564022,"login":"0xNiel","node_id":"U_kgDOB11v9g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":