make the local environment start cleanly\n\n- Pin LocalStack to 4.12.0. Current releases refuse to start without an\n  account token. make localstack-start now runs it detached, and\n  localstack-stop removes it. Health checks use localhost instead of\n  host.docker.internal, which doesn''t resolve on the host.\n- Remove kind host port mappings for unused NodePorts. They took host\n  ports 9080 and 9082, the same ports run-local and web-dev use.\n- Raise the AWS provider memory limit to 1Gi and drop the CPU limit.\n  At 256Mi / 200m the Upjet providers sat in startup or got OOMKilled.\n- Fix the dev-up banner, which listed the wrong ports.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bf7216eeb9b53c1504f703a428d421ad1347b2ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/git/trees/bf7216eeb9b53c1504f703a428d421ad1347b2ca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/git/commits/2c93ea75d2be9e8be422a5a3bd51ef9ba8a99bdd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123564022?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0xNiel","id":123564022,"login":"0xNiel","node_id":"U_kgDOB11v9g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/0xNiel/platform-manager/commit/2c93ea75d2be9e8be422a5a3bd51ef9ba8a99bdd","node_id":"C_kwDOQmgX-toAKDJjOTNlYTc1ZDJiZTllOGJlNDIyYTVhM2JkNTFlZjliYThhOTliZGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/0xNiel/platform-manager/commit/5c85dcace13448444e09d2114db8f212824792a7","sha":"5c85dcace13448444e09d2114db8f212824792a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/commits/5c85dcace13448444e09d2114db8f212824792a7"}],"sha":"2c93ea75d2be9e8be422a5a3bd51ef9ba8a99bdd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/commits/2c93ea75d2be9e8be422a5a3bd51ef9ba8a99bdd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123564022?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0xNiel","id":123564022,"login":"0xNiel","node_id":"U_kgDOB11v9g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/commits/5c85dcace13448444e09d2114db8f212824792a7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T01:06:23Z","email":"123564022+0xNiel@users.noreply.github.com","name":"0xNiel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T01:06:23Z","email":"123564022+0xNiel@users.noreply.github.com","name":"0xNiel"},"message":"chore: fix all golangci-lint findings\n\nClears all 78 findings (the default output caps showed 47).\n\n- Route handler JSON responses through WriteJSON, which now logs encode\n  errors, and add a queryFlag helper for boolean query params.\n- Discard teardown Close errors explicitly and remove the unused\n  terminalStreamHandler type.\n- Drop error returns that were always nil from best-effort scans, and\n  the unused ctx parameter from collectTopIssues.\n- Name repeated literals (paused annotation, condition statuses, Argo\n  statuses, Pod kind), use tagged switches, preallocate drift results,\n  rename parameters that shadowed the client package, and wrap long\n  lines in main.go.\n- Build the ownership tree apiVersion with schema.GroupVersion so core\n  resources get \"v1\" instead of \"/v1\".\n- Tests: check w.Write results and drop the deprecated rand.Seed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"40429ac77a0ee53915242f992262569d36844d4a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/git/trees/40429ac77a0ee53915242f992262569d36844d4a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/git/commits/5c85dcace13448444e09d2114db8f212824792a7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123564022?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0xNiel","id":123564022,"login":"0xNiel","node_id":"U_kgDOB11v9g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/0xNiel/platform-manager/commit/5c85dcace13448444e09d2114db8f212824792a7","node_id":"C_kwDOQmgX-toAKDVjODVkY2FjZTEzNDQ4NDQ0ZTA5ZDIxMTRkYjhmMjEyODI0NzkyYTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/0xNiel/platform-manager/commit/a1477b2a8631f88b3aed0618e8aa743a66783114","sha":"a1477b2a8631f88b3aed0618e8aa743a66783114","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/commits/a1477b2a8631f88b3aed0618e8aa743a66783114"}],"sha":"5c85dcace13448444e09d2114db8f212824792a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/commits/5c85dcace13448444e09d2114db8f212824792a7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123564022?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0xNiel","id":123564022,"login":"0xNiel","node_id":"U_kgDOB11v9g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/commits/a1477b2a8631f88b3aed0618e8aa743a66783114/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T01:06:22Z","email":"123564022+0xNiel@users.noreply.github.com","name":"0xNiel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T01:06:22Z","email":"123564022+0xNiel@users.noreply.github.com","name":"0xNiel"},"message":"fix(audit): read the request ID from chi''s context key\n\nThe audit logger looked up ctx.Value(\"requestID\"), but chi''s RequestID\nmiddleware stores it under middleware.RequestIDKey, so audit entries\nnever included a request ID. Use middleware.GetReqID and update the\ntest to set the ID the way chi does.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f3d33ac0bfff81ad1db9b6e0b61abb9e8d653449","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/git/trees/f3d33ac0bfff81ad1db9b6e0b61abb9e8d653449"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/git/commits/a1477b2a8631f88b3aed0618e8aa743a66783114","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123564022?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0xNiel","id":123564022,"login":"0xNiel","node_id":"U_kgDOB11v9g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/0xNiel/platform-manager/commit/a1477b2a8631f88b3aed0618e8aa743a66783114","node_id":"C_kwDOQmgX-toAKGExNDc3YjJhODYzMWY4OGIzYWVkMDYxOGU4YWE3NDNhNjY3ODMxMTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/0xNiel/platform-manager/commit/b4f4424be24d65d55ffa70dd25f2dac49eed680e","sha":"b4f4424be24d65d55ffa70dd25f2dac49eed680e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/commits/b4f4424be24d65d55ffa70dd25f2dac49eed680e"}],"sha":"a1477b2a8631f88b3aed0618e8aa743a66783114","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/commits/a1477b2a8631f88b3aed0618e8aa743a66783114"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123564022?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0xNiel","id":123564022,"login":"0xNiel","node_id":"U_kgDOB11v9g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/commits/b4f4424be24d65d55ffa70dd25f2dac49eed680e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T01:06:22Z","email":"123564022+0xNiel@users.noreply.github.com","name":"0xNiel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T01:06:22Z","email":"123564022+0xNiel@users.noreply.github.com","name":"0xNiel"},"message":"fix(iam): compare role policies against the spec before reporting drift\n\ncheckInlinePoliciesDrift ignored the spec it was given and\ncheckAttachedPoliciesDrift had no spec at all, so every inline or\nattached policy on a role was reported as critical extra_privileges,\nincluding ones the spec declares.\n\nCheck AWS against spec.forProvider.inlinePolicy and managedPolicyArns,\nreport declared inline policies missing from AWS as missing_privileges,\nand document the remaining gaps (inline policy content is not compared,\nRolePolicyAttachment resources are not looked up).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c9a9bbad50d6c180ca52ee82cc3ec9f72f4592f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/git/trees/c9a9bbad50d6c180ca52ee82cc3ec9f72f4592f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/git/commits/b4f4424be24d65d55ffa70dd25f2dac49eed680e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123564022?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0xNiel","id":123564022,"login":"0xNiel","node_id":"U_kgDOB11v9g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/0xNiel/platform-manager/commit/b4f4424be24d65d55ffa70dd25f2dac49eed680e","node_id":"C_kwDOQmgX-toAKGI0ZjQ0MjRiZTI0ZDY1ZDU1ZmZhNzBkZDI1ZjJkYWM0OWVlZDY4MGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/0xNiel/platform-manager/commit/28e3bcf06802195631ee096181d0e7163d2d37ba","sha":"28e3bcf06802195631ee096181d0e7163d2d37ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/commits/28e3bcf06802195631ee096181d0e7163d2d37ba"}],"sha":"b4f4424be24d65d55ffa70dd25f2dac49eed680e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/commits/b4f4424be24d65d55ffa70dd25f2dac49eed680e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123564022?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0xNiel","id":123564022,"login":"0xNiel","node_id":"U_kgDOB11v9g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/commits/28e3bcf06802195631ee096181d0e7163d2d37ba/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T00:28:11Z","email":"123564022+0xNiel@users.noreply.github.com","name":"0xNiel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T00:28:11Z","email":"123564022+0xNiel@users.noreply.github.com","name":"0xNiel"},"message":"fix(controller): resolve GVK from scheme when writing ResourceSummaries\n\ncontroller-runtime returns typed list items with an empty TypeMeta, so\nobj.GetObjectKind() gave an empty group, version, and kind for every\nDeployment, StatefulSet, DaemonSet, Job, and CronJob. That left those\nsummaries without a kind, named them <tenant>--<ns>-<name> so that\ndifferent kinds with the same name overwrote each other, and made the\norphan cleanup fail its lookup on every scan.\n\nResolve the GVK with client.GroupVersionKindFor and pass it to\ngenerateResourceSummaryName. Tests now assert group and version too,\nand a new spec covers a Deployment and a Job sharing a name.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"280724e3ec526b1b4422808e4a8216e714fb9cbf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/git/trees/280724e3ec526b1b4422808e4a8216e714fb9cbf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/git/commits/28e3bcf06802195631ee096181d0e7163d2d37ba","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123564022?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0xNiel","id":123564022,"login":"0xNiel","node_id":"U_kgDOB11v9g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/0xNiel/platform-manager/commit/28e3bcf06802195631ee096181d0e7163d2d37ba","node_id":"C_kwDOQmgX-toAKDI4ZTNiY2YwNjgwMjE5NTYzMWVlMDk2MTgxZDBlNzE2M2QyZDM3YmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/0xNiel/platform-manager/commit/9df1f24179d65352d0777e1296ab19f48ebf0937","sha":"9df1f24179d653