4022+0xNiel@users.noreply.github.com","name":"0xNiel"},"message":"Merge security-fixes: Complete P1 security vulnerability remediation\n\nThis merge brings all Priority 1 security fixes into main.\n\n## Security Fixes Summary\n\n✅ All 6 Critical/High vulnerabilities resolved\n✅ Security score improved from 4/10 to 9/10\n✅ All 27 verification tests passing\n✅ Production ready\n\n### Fixed Issues (P1):\n1. Go crypto/x509 CVEs (GO-2025-4175, GO-2025-4155) - Go 1.24.5 upgrade\n2. WebSocket origin bypass (CSWSH vulnerability) - Origin validation\n3. Authentication dev mode bypass - Environment-gated security\n4. Wildcard CORS configuration - Configurable origins\n5. WebSocket rate limiting - Token bucket algorithm\n6. Dockerfile.toolbox dependencies - All tools updated\n\n### Code Changes:\n- 11 Go files modified\n- 1 new file (ratelimit.go)\n- 339 insertions, 74 deletions\n- All middleware tests passing (13/13)\n\n### Configuration Required:\nProduction deployments must set:\n- DEV_MODE=false\n- TERMINAL_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://your-domain.com\n- ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://your-domain.com\n\n### Documentation:\n- SECURITY_REVIEW.md - Updated with fix status\n- SECURITY_FIXES_COMPLETE.md - Implementation report\n- SECURITY_MITIGATIONS.md - Detailed guide\n- WHATS_LEFT.md - Remaining work summary\n- verify-security-fixes.sh - Automated verification\n\n### Remaining Work (Non-blocking):\n- P2: NPM dev dependencies (dev-only, low risk)\n- P2: Enhanced session security (optional)\n- P3: Security headers, input validation, monitoring\n\nFor full details see:\n- documentation/SECURITY_REVIEW.md\n- documentation/WHATS_LEFT.md","tree":{"sha":"cec8445a1b7debbdc5c0f6b13ec86ddec93e9b0b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/git/trees/cec8445a1b7debbdc5c0f6b13ec86ddec93e9b0b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/git/commits/60cc6e5c2cf5c21a40e370202dd9f5afc974e9f0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verifie