s/f1953a2496f1cdc33dfc3422bd9a889376ae1d8f"}],"sha":"5904927919dc5a9dcc11ebfc56359208e399cadf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/commits/5904927919dc5a9dcc11ebfc56359208e399cadf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123564022?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0xNiel","id":123564022,"login":"0xNiel","node_id":"U_kgDOB11v9g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/commits/f1953a2496f1cdc33dfc3422bd9a889376ae1d8f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-06T18:57:13Z","email":"123564022+0xNiel@users.noreply.github.com","name":"0xNiel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-06T18:57:13Z","email":"123564022+0xNiel@users.noreply.github.com","name":"0xNiel"},"message":"security: Implement P1 security fixes from security review\n\nThis commit implements the Priority 1 (immediate) security fixes identified\nin the security review (documented in SECURITY_REVIEW.md).\n\n## Critical Fixes Implemented\n\n### 1. Go Version Update (Fixes GO-2025-4175, GO-2025-4155)\n- Updated Go from 1.24.0 to 1.24.5 in go.mod\n- Updated Dockerfile to use golang:1.24.5\n- Resolves crypto/x509 vulnerabilities in certificate validation\n\n### 2. Dockerfile.toolbox Dependency Updates\n- Alpine Linux: 3.19 → 3.21\n- kubectl: v1.29.0 → v1.33.0\n- Helm: v3.14.0 → v3.16.3\n- ArgoCD CLI: v2.10.0 → v2.13.1\n- AWS CLI: pinned to version 1.32.0 (was unpinned)\n- Updated references in bash functions\n\n### 3. WebSocket Origin Validation (CRITICAL)\n**Issue:** WebSocket upgrader accepted connections from ANY origin (CSWSH vulnerability)\n\n**Fix:**\n- Added SecurityConfig struct to terminal package\n- Implemented origin validation in WebSocket upgrader\n- Added TERMINAL_ALLOWED_ORIGINS environment variable\n- Added DEV_MODE environment variable for development\n- Created createUpgrader() method with proper CheckOrigin validation\n- Logs rejected connection attempts\n\n**Configuration:**\n```yaml\nenv:\n  - name: TERMINAL_ALLOWED_ORIGINS\n    value: \"https://platform.company.com,https://staging.company.com\"\n  - name: DEV_MODE\n    value: \"false\"  # true only in development\n```\n\n### 4. Authentication Dev Mode Bypass Fix (CRITICAL)\n**Issue:** X-Dev-Role header bypassed all authentication\n\n**Fix:**\n- Added DEV_MODE environment variable check\n- Dev headers only work when DEV_MODE=true\n- Added role validation (isValidRole function)\n- Anonymous read-only access in production when no auth\n- Enhanced logging for dev mode usage\n\n### 5. CORS Configuration Hardening\n**Issue:** Wildcard CORS (*) allowed requests from any origin\n\n**Fix:**\n- Implemented CORSConfig struct with allowed origins\n- CORS respects DEV_MODE environment variable\n- In production: only configured origins allowed\n- In dev mode: wildcard still allowed for convenience\n- Added ALLOWED_ORIGINS environment variable\n- Proper Vary header for caching\n\n### 6. WebSocket Rate Limiting\n**Issue:** No rate limiting on WebSocket input (DoS risk)\n\n**Fix:**\n- Created RateLimiter with token bucket algorithm\n- Default: 100 tokens burst, refill 10/sec\n- Added RateLimiter to Session struct\n- Integrated into WebSocket read loop\n- Logs rate limit exceedances\n\n## Files Modified\n\n**Go Code:**\n- go.mod: Go version 1.24.5\n- Dockerfile: golang:1.24.5\n- Dockerfile.toolbox: Updated all tool versions\n- internal/terminal/types.go: Added SecurityConfig, RateLimiter to Session\n- internal/terminal/ratelimit.go: NEW - Rate limiting implementation\n- internal/terminal/manager.go: Initialize RateLimiter for sessions\n- internal/api/handlers/terminal.go: Origin validation, rate limiting\n- internal/api/middleware/auth.go: Dev mode protection\n- internal/api/middleware/cors.go: Configurable CORS\n- internal/api/server.go: Load security configs from environment\n\n**Tests:**\n- internal/api/middleware/authz_test.go: Updated for terminal capability\n\n## Security Impact\n\n**Before:**\n- WebSocket: CRITICAL - Any origin accepted\n- Auth: CRITICAL - Easy bypass with dev header\n- CORS: MEDIUM - All origins allowed\n- Rate Limiting: MEDIUM - No protection\n- Dependencies: HIGH - Known CVEs\n\n**After:**\n- WebSocket: SECURE - Origin validation enforced\n- Auth: SECURE - Dev mode gated by environment\n- CORS: SECURE - Configurable origins\n- Rate Limiting: PROTECTED - Token bucket limiting\n- Dependencies: UPDATED - Latest secure versions\n\n## Testing\n\n✅ All middleware tests pass (13/13)\n✅ Code compiles successfully\n✅ Rate limiting functional\n✅ Origin validation functional\n✅ Dev mode protection functional\n\n## Environment Variables Required\n\nFor production deployment, set:\n```bash\nDEV_MODE=false\nTERMINAL_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://platform.yourcompany.com\nALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://platform.yourcompany.com\n```\n\nFor development:\n```bash\nDEV_MODE=true\n# Origins not required in dev mode\n```\n\n## Breaking Changes\n\nNone - All changes are backward compatible with proper environment configuration.\nIn dev mode (DEV_MODE=true), behavior is unchanged.\n\n## Next Steps\n\n- P2: Enhanced session security (session tokens)\n- P2: Additional security headers\n- P3: Input validation framework\n- P3: Security monitoring and alerting\n\n## References\n\n- Security Review: documentation/SECURITY_REVIEW.md\n- Implementation Guide: documentation/SECURITY_MITIGATIONS.md\n- GO-2025-4175: https://pkg.go.dev/vuln/GO-2025-4175\n- GO-2025-4155: https://pkg.go.dev/vuln/GO-2025-4155","tree":{"sha":"31921e471fc949781f4fb2be7bd97470e3424284","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/git/trees/31921e471fc949781f4fb2be7bd97470e3424284"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/git/commits/f1953a2496f1cdc33dfc3422bd9a889376ae1d8f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123564022?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0xNiel","id":123564022,"login":"0xNiel","node_id":"U_kgDOB11v9g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/0xNiel/platform-manager/commit/f1953a2496f1cdc33dfc3422bd9a889376ae1d8f","node_id":"C_kwDOQmgX-toAKGYxOTUzYTI0OTZmMWNkYzMzZGZjMzQyMmJkOWE4ODkzNzZhZTFkOGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/0xNiel/platform-manager/commit/b75f361882ce5c132d1788dde5f3d5a80d8ea337","sha":"b75f361882ce5c132d1788dde5f3d5a80d8ea337","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/commits/b75f361882ce5c132d1788dde5f3d5a80d8ea337"}],"sha"