url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0xNiel","id":123564022,"login":"0xNiel","node_id":"U_kgDOB11v9g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/commits/2bda456c5f0e4eba58fe5ed56e07d2f353e62373/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-06T18:41:43Z","email":"123564022+0xNiel@users.noreply.github.com","name":"0xNiel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-06T18:41:43Z","email":"123564022+0xNiel@users.noreply.github.com","name":"0xNiel"},"message":"security: Comprehensive security and vulnerability review\n\nThis commit adds comprehensive security documentation including:\n\n- SECURITY_REVIEW.md: Complete vulnerability assessment covering:\n  * 2 HIGH severity Go crypto/x509 vulnerabilities (GO-2025-4175, GO-2025-4155)\n  * 15 npm package vulnerabilities (4 HIGH, 11 MODERATE)\n  * Critical WebSocket origin validation bypass\n  * Authentication dev mode bypass vulnerability\n  * CORS wildcard configuration issues\n  * Outdated Dockerfile.toolbox dependencies\n  * Session security concerns\n  * Input validation gaps\n\n- SECURITY_MITIGATIONS.md: Detailed remediation guide with:\n  * Step-by-step fix implementations\n  * Code examples for secure configurations\n  * WebSocket origin validation\n  * Authentication middleware hardening\n  * CORS restrictions\n  * Rate limiting implementation\n  * Enhanced session security with tokens\n  * Testing and deployment checklists\n  * Monitoring and alerting recommendations\n\nKey Findings:\n- Go 1.25.4 → 1.25.5 upgrade required\n- kubectl v1.29.0 → v1.33.0 upgrade needed\n- Helm v3.14.0 → v3.16.3 upgrade needed\n- ArgoCD CLI v2.10.0 → v2.13.1 upgrade needed\n- Multiple npm packages need updates\n- Critical authentication bypass via X-Dev-Role header\n- WebSocket accepts connections from any origin\n- Wildcard CORS allows any origin\n\nRisk Assessment: 17 total vulnerabilities identified\nPriority 1 (Immediate): 6 issues\nPriority 2 (High): 8 issues\nPriority 3 (Medium): 3 issues\n\nEstimated remediation effort: 2 weeks\n\nThis is the initial security audit - implementation of fixes\nto follow in subsequent commits.\n\nReferences:\n- https://pkg.go.dev/vuln/GO-2025-4175\n- https://pkg.go.dev/vuln/GO-2025-4155\n- https://github.com/advisories (npm advisories)\n- OWASP Top 10 2021\n- Kubernetes Security Best Practices","tree":{"sha":"7d25d244d867ff586a2ae446559ea6bd39e22b5d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/git/trees/7d25d244d867ff586a2ae446559ea6bd39e22b5d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/git/commits/2bda456c5f0e4eba58fe5ed56e07d2f353e62373","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123564022?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0xNiel","id":123564022,"login":"0xNiel","node_id":"U_kgDOB11v9g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/received_events","repos_url":"http