thor":{"date":"2025-12-10T23:22:48Z","email":"123564022+0xNiel@users.noreply.github.com","name":"0xNiel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-10T23:22:48Z","email":"123564022+0xNiel@users.noreply.github.com","name":"0xNiel"},"message":"Phase 1: Backend skeleton and global overview\n\nThis commit implements Phase 1 of the Platform Manager implementation plan:\n\n- Initialize Kubebuilder project with domain platform.io\n- Define 4 CRDs: Tenant, TenantHealth, ResourceSummary, PlatformHealth\n- Implement TenantReconciler controller that:\n  - Manages tenant lifecycle with finalizers\n  - Creates TenantHealth resources for each tenant\n  - Counts namespaces belonging to each tenant\n  - Sets tenant phase and conditions\n- Implement HTTP API server (Chi router) with endpoints:\n  - GET /healthz, /readyz - Health checks\n  - GET /api/v1/tenants - List all tenants\n  - GET /api/v1/tenants/:id - Get tenant details\n  - GET /api/v1/tenants/:id/resources - List tenant resources\n  - GET /api/v1/health/platform - Global platform health\n  - GET /api/v1/health/tenants - List tenant health\n  - GET /api/v1/health/tenants/:id - Get tenant health\n- Implement auth middleware for OAuth2Proxy header extraction\n- Add CORS middleware for development\n\nThe controller and API server are integrated into the manager as runnables\nand can be started with: go run ./cmd/main.go","tree":{"sha":"2f89c3d5d1a4d2378b28e26e2e7b684ff1f50e4a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/git/trees/2f89c3d5d1a4d2378b28e26e2e7b684ff1f50e4a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xNiel/platform-manager/git/commits/dee2bba91ab028793d8e21c4c62bbf960db4c6cd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123564022?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNiel/followers","followi