/api.github.com/users/Lafimouad","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Lafimouad/mfe-ecommerce-ts/commits/bd561ec2a0cea8c6c5c9ff17d3f4394c2ceea0e6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-26T01:11:33Z","email":"mouad19971@gmail.com","name":"Lafimouad"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-26T01:11:33Z","email":"mouad19971@gmail.com","name":"Lafimouad"},"message":"feat(auth): add micro frontend for authentication with login, signup, and user profile features\n\n- Created Auth MFE with necessary components: Login, Signup, UserProfile, and AuthContext.\n- Implemented session management using localStorage for persistent login.\n- Added ProtectedRoute component to guard routes based on authentication state.\n- Integrated custom events for authentication state sharing between MFEs.\n- Updated README with setup instructions and usage examples.\n- Configured Webpack for module federation to expose Auth MFE components.\n\nchore: add .gitignore file to exclude build artifacts and environment variables\n\nchore: update package.json files across MFEs to include necessary dependencies and devDependencies\n\nfix(cart): correct import statements in bootstrap file\n\nfix(checkout): correct import statements in bootstrap file\n\nfix(products): correct import statements in bootstrap file\n\nfeat(store-host): integrate Auth MFE into the main application with routing\n\nchore(ui): update Button component to accept children and adjust imports accordingly","tree":{"sha":"ef7c75c96e32402738e6565939290a8ac111e988","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Lafimouad/mfe-ecommerce-ts/git/trees/ef7c75c96e32402738e6565939290a8ac111e988"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Lafimouad/mfe-ecommerce-ts/git/commits/bd561ec2a0cea8c6c5c9ff17d3f4394c2ceea0e6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57266794?v=4","events_url":"h