dded:\n- legacy-maintenance: General legacy system maintenance\n- legacy-cobol: COBOL-specific maintenance\n- legacy-desktop: VB6/Delphi/FoxPro desktop apps\n- legacy-4gl: Oracle Forms/PowerBuilder/RPG AS400\n- cobol-modernization: COBOL to modern languages migration\n- vb6-modernization: VB6 to .NET/modern migration\n- stack-adoption: New technology stack adoption\n- cloud-native: Cloud-native architecture setup\n- design-system: Design system creation/maintenance\n- ux-discovery: UX research and discovery\n- accessibility-audit: WCAG accessibility audit\n- supply-chain-security: Supply chain security focus\n\nExisting workflows improved with missing agents:\n- bug: Added Error Handling, Logging Strategy\n- feature: Added User Research, Prototyping, Design System\n- debt: Added Technical Debt, Dependency Management\n- performance: Added FinOps, CDN, Caching Strategy\n- cicd: Added Container Orchestration, IaC, GitOps\n- architecture: Added DDD, Event-Driven Architecture\n- sre: Added Chaos & Resilience, Error Handling\n- security-audit: Added Cloud Security, Supply Chain\n- migration: Added Platform Evolution, Legacy agents\n- And 22 more workflows with relevant agents","tree":{"sha":"9d4fd727b1d4085bbcd0500ef518fd0ad550f64f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlexaieDev/Agentic_configurations/git/trees/9d4fd727b1d4085bbcd0500ef518fd0ad550f64f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlexaieDev/Agentic_configurations/git/commits/266070bf4b66580d71b6038f483c4cb28ce6c03e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/142338625?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexaieDev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexaieDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexaieDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexaieDev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url"