exaieDev/Agentic_configurations/commits/b4f4be292b7a7d7c43f94da61e5a41da98fb72c4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-27T23:20:12Z","email":"alexhen.work@gmail.com","name":"Alex"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-27T23:20:12Z","email":"alexhen.work@gmail.com","name":"Alex"},"message":"fix: resolve JS syntax errors from PowerShell regex interpretation\n\nBug fixes in build-web-ui.ps1:\n1. Replace -replace with .Replace() for placeholder substitution\n   - PowerShell''s -replace interprets $ in replacement string as\n     regex backreferences, breaking content with $_ patterns\n2. Replace -replace with .Replace() for </ escaping\n   - Same regex interpretation issue\n\nRoot cause: Agent configs contain PowerShell code examples with $_\nvariables, which were being interpreted by the regex engine instead\nof being treated as literal text.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3e7c294563ff97bd13f003a2c3503317b6d2f655","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlexaieDev/Agentic_configurations/git/trees/3e7c294563ff97bd13f003a2c3503317b6d2f655"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlexaieDev/Agentic_configurations/git/commits/b4f4be292b7a7d7c43f94da61e5a41da98fb72c4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/142338625?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexaieDev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexaieDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexaieDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexaieDev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlexaieDev","id":142338625,"login":"AlexaieDev","node_id":"U_kgDOCHvqQQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexaieDev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexaieDev/received_events","repos_url":"https: