rations/commits/7cdb2ce20449a748dc195d4d392e270376097e97/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-27T21:46:29Z","email":"alexhen.work@gmail.com","name":"Alex"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-27T21:46:29Z","email":"alexhen.work@gmail.com","name":"Alex"},"message":"fix: restore web UI features with template-based build\n\n- Add web/index-template.html with all UI features (wizard, workflows,\n  kits by maturity, phases sections)\n- Refactor build-web-ui.ps1 to use template approach:\n  - Only regenerates agents array, preserves all UI sections\n  - Uses JavaScriptStringEncode for proper JS escaping\n  - Prevents template literal injection bugs\n- Restore 18k+ lines of UI functionality lost in previous build\n\nBREAKING: Build script now requires index-template.html with\n__AGENTS_DATA_PLACEHOLDER__ marker","tree":{"sha":"a563c4a93a804d4553fff7d1d49888cad11fa432","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlexaieDev/Agentic_configurations/git/trees/a563c4a93a804d4553fff7d1d49888cad11fa432"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlexaieDev/Agentic_configurations/git/commits/7cdb2ce20449a748dc195d4d392e270376097e97","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/142338625?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexaieDev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexaieDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexaieDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexaieDev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlexaieDev","id":142338625,"login":"AlexaieDev","node_id":"U_kgDOCHvqQQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexaieDev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexaieDev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexaieDev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexaieDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexaieDev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexaieDev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AlexaieDev/Agentic_configurations/commit/7cdb2ce20449a748dc195d4d392e270376097e97","node_id":"C_kwDOQmqNN9oAKDdjZGIyY2UyMDQ0OWE3NDhkYzE5NWQ0ZDM5MmUyNzAzNzYwOTdlOTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AlexaieDev/Agentic_configurations/commit/99253df81d7f404c5c75d15ea77ba178015c3cb8","sha":"99253df81d7f404c5c75d15ea77ba178015c3cb8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlexaieDev/Agentic_configurations/commits/99253df81d7f404c5c75d15ea77ba178015c3cb8"}],"sha":"7cdb2ce20449a748dc195d4d392e270376097e97","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlexaieDev/Agentic_configurations/commits/7cdb2ce20449a748dc195d4d392e270376097e97"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/142338625?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexaieDev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexaieDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexaieDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexaieDev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlexaieDev","id":142338625,"login":"AlexaieDev","node_id":"U_kgDOCHvqQQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexaieDev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexaieDev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexaieDev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexaieDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexaieDev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexaieDev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlexaieDev/Agentic_configurations/commits/99253df81d7f404c5c75d15ea77ba178015c3cb8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-27T11:17:13Z","email":"alexhen.work@gmail.com","name":"Alex"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-27T11:17:13Z","email":"alexhen.work@gmail.com","name":"Alex"},"message":"feat: expand 62 agents to comprehensive guides (5-10x content increase)\n\nMajor quality improvements across multiple agent categories:\n\n- Legacy Maintenance (15): COBOL, VB6, Delphi 4-7, FoxPro, RPG/AS400, etc.\n- Migrations (16): All legacy-to-modern migration paths with detailed workflows\n- Mobile Platform (10): Architecture, security, CI/CD, offline-first, push notifications\n- Planning (4): Sprint, estimation, roadmap, stakeholder management\n- Quality (2): Bug Hunter (1900 lines), Performance & Efficiency (1700 lines)\n- Testing (2): Test Strategy (2000 lines), E2E Testing (2050 lines)\n- Process (3): API Design (2400 lines), Idea Improver, Technology Radar\n- Security (2): Authentication (2900 lines), License Reviewer\n- Web Platform (3): Frontend, Accessibility, Product Discovery\n- DevOps (1): Infrastructure as Code (3000 lines)\n- Cloud (1): Cloud Architecture (1500 lines)\n- Languages (2): TypeScript/Node.js, Python\n\nAll expanded agents now include:\n- Comprehensive frameworks with ASCII diagrams\n- Platform-specific code examples (TypeScript/language-appropriate)\n- Anti-patterns with before/after corrections\n- Detailed Definition of Done checklists\n- Coordination matrices with other agents\n\nRegenerated web UI with all 179 agents embedded.","tree":{"sha":"13d7fb993410dd780a8a7278f755c82f2e50bed4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlexaieDev/Agentic_configurations/git/trees/13d7fb993410dd780a8a7278f755c82f2e50bed4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlexaieDev/Agentic_configurations/git/commits/99253df81d7f404c5c75d15ea77ba178015c3cb8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/142338625?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.c