/api.github.com/users/AlexaieDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexaieDev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexaieDev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlexaieDev/Agentic_configurations/commits/45e186f773aea5762f44ec1e36647624ef87557c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-22T13:35:55Z","email":"alexhen.work@gmail.com","name":"Alex"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-22T13:35:55Z","email":"alexhen.work@gmail.com","name":"Alex"},"message":"feat: add 31 lifecycle agents and update web UI with 179 agents\n\nNew agent categories covering full product lifecycle:\n- Discovery (5): market-research, competitor-analysis, user-research, product-vision, mvp-definition\n- Planning (5): estimation, roadmap, sprint-planning, backlog-management, stakeholder-management\n- Design (5): ux-research, ui-design, prototyping, user-journey, usability-testing\n- Business (4): business-model, pricing-strategy, monetization, revenue-optimization\n- Growth (8): seo, content-marketing, social-media, email-marketing, growth-hacking, analytics, conversion-optimization, user-retention\n- Process (3): code-generator, dependency-management, pair-programming\n- Platform-web (1): backend-web\n\nWeb UI improvements:\n- Updated agents array with all 179 agents from repository\n- Added categoryIcons and categoryNames for new categories\n- Added v3.0 pack name\n- Scripts updated for new category mappings\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c12e0fd9acb0cffcb9ffaedd4c5fe5b219cd5cb7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlexaieDev/Agentic_configurations/git/trees/c12e0fd9acb0cffcb9ffaedd4c5fe5b219cd5cb7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlexaieDev/Agentic_configurations/git/commits/45e186f773aea5762f44ec1e36647624ef87557c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"commi