gine, WebSocket & Real-time\n\n## Architecture (5 new)\n- Event-Driven, DDD, Microservices\n- Clean Architecture, Monolith to Microservices\n\n## Testing (6 new)\n- E2E Testing, Visual Regression, Load Testing\n- Contract Testing, Mutation Testing, A/B Testing\n\n## Security (4 new)\n- Authentication, Authorization\n- Secret Management, Vulnerability Management\n\n## DevOps (4 new)\n- Infrastructure as Code, Container Orchestration\n- Service Mesh, CDN\n\n## Cloud (2 new)\n- Serverless, Multi-Cloud\n\n## Mobile (4 new)\n- App Store Optimization, Push Notification\n- Offline-First, Deep Linking\n\n## Data (3 new)\n- Data Pipeline, Data Quality, ML Ops\n\n## Integrations (5 new)\n- Payment, Email Delivery, File Storage\n- Notification Hub, Third-Party Integration\n\n## Transversal (10 new)\n- Migration, Technology Radar, Idea Improver\n- Code Review, Onboarding, ADR\n- Feature Flag, Logging Strategy\n- Error Handling, Configuration Management\n\nTotal: 102 unique agents covering the complete software lifecycle","tree":{"sha":"fe09a2ce47709527c047409c46acbabfaad256a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlexaieDev/Agentic_configurations/git/trees/fe09a2ce47709527c047409c46acbabfaad256a9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlexaieDev/Agentic_configurations/git/commits/ab4513c62bf53af77af9ac17bceb24ea0d4225ea","verification":{"payload":"tree fe09a2ce47709527c047409c46acbabfaad256a9\nparent c855d936f9ec034803fce1c6c9d8b9ca5bfaabd7\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1765863148 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1765863148 +0000\n\nfeat: expand to 100+ agents for comprehensive coverage (v3.0)\n\nMajor expansion adding 62 new specialized agents:\n\n## Web/Frontend (6 new)\n- Responsive Design, CSS Architecture, Animation & Motion\n- PWA, State Management, Micro-Frontend\n\n## Backend (6 new)\n- GraphQL, Message Queue, Caching Strategy\n- Search Engine, WebSocket & Real-time\n\n## Architecture (5 new)\n- Event-Driven, DDD, Microservices\n- Clean Architectur