com/users/darshan45672/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darshan45672/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/darshan45672","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/darshan45672/micro-gke/commits/2ebc9c69e2934923163e70f58ce0024eed09aa7a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-11T13:04:39Z","email":"drshnbhandary@gmail.com","name":"darshan45672"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-11T13:04:39Z","email":"drshnbhandary@gmail.com","name":"darshan45672"},"message":"Add deployment guide and script for micro frontends on GKE\n\n- Create README-GKE.md with detailed steps for deploying Next.js and Vue.js micro frontends to Google Kubernetes Engine.\n- Include prerequisites, setup instructions, API enabling, image building, and deployment steps.\n- Add deploy-to-gke.sh script to automate the deployment process, including image building, tagging, pushing, and Kubernetes manifest creation.\n- Implement error handling and user prompts for configuration.\n- Provide instructions for accessing applications and updating environment variables post-deployment.","tree":{"sha":"9d1af387581fc520a6a7b78d8a012601d50328ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/darshan45672/micro-gke/git/trees/9d1af387581fc520a6a7b78d8a012601d50328ca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/darshan45672/micro-gke/git/commits/2ebc9c69e2934923163e70f58ce0024eed09aa7a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109609462?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darshan45672/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darshan45672/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darshan45672/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darshan45672/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/darshan456