eployment guide for GKE, including setup, deployment scripts, and Kubernetes manifests\n\n- Created PODMAN-GUIDE.md with detailed instructions for using Podman with GKE.\n- Added QUICKSTART.md for quick reference commands and steps.\n- Implemented cleanup script (cleanup-gke.sh) for removing GKE resources.\n- Developed deployment script (deploy-to-gke.sh) for automating the deployment process.\n- Added Kubernetes manifests for micro frontends (mf1 and mf2) including deployments, services, and HPA configurations.\n- Created ingress configuration (ingress.yaml) for managing traffic to the applications.\n- Included managed certificate configuration (managed-cert.yaml) for HTTPS support.\n- Developed load testing script (load-test.sh) to demonstrate auto-scaling capabilities.\n- Implemented setup script (setup-podman-gcr.sh) for Podman authentication with Google Container Registry.","tree":{"sha":"629a60e5df178155b315371599b0399c428d3d43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/darshan45672/micro-gke/git/trees/629a60e5df178155b315371599b0399c428d3d43"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/darshan45672/micro-gke/git/commits/6490a708efb694eb40daf21c60773048a7500b55","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109609462?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darshan45672/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darshan45672/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darshan45672/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darshan45672/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/darshan45672","id":109609462,"login":"darshan45672","node_id":"U_kgDOBoiB9g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darshan45672/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darshan45672/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darshan45672/repos","