ntities app has basePath: ''/entities'' in next.config.ts, but all fetch\ncalls were using ''/api/*'' paths without the basePath prefix, causing 404\nerrors in production.\n\nCreated useApiUrl hook and getApiUrl utility matching the pattern from\ndashboard/payments apps, and updated all 15 affected files to use it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6784dd081827d8423056cc9c5b912d04451349c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/indiebuildinganton-gif/pleeno-monorepo/git/trees/6784dd081827d8423056cc9c5b912d04451349c5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/indiebuildinganton-gif/pleeno-monorepo/git/commits/53faf87525520dac3f0e1b0b531860dcfd34144c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234336247?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/indiebuildinganton-gif","id":234336247,"login":"indiebuildinganton-gif","node_id":"U_kgDODfev9w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/indiebuildinganton-gif/pleeno-monorepo/commit/53faf87525520dac3f