api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/indiebuildinganton-gif/pleeno-monorepo/commits/9b1b9eb126c569b4b6798904ca16ad9dbe9078ca/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-19T02:36:05Z","email":"indiebuildinganton@gmail.com","name":"mystbrent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-19T02:36:05Z","email":"indiebuildinganton@gmail.com","name":"mystbrent"},"message":"fix: use createServerClientFromRequest for cross-subdomain cookie auth in Vercel\n\nThe dashboard API routes were using createServerClient() which reads cookies\nfrom next/headers. In Vercel deployments with cross-subdomain authentication\n(dashboard.plenno.com.au cookies set from auth.plenno.com.au), cookies()\ndoesn''t find the auth cookies but request.cookies does.\n\nChanges:\n- Switch all 14 API routes to use createServerClientFromRequest(request)\n- Disable ISR caching (revalidate=0) for authenticated routes\n- Add dynamic=''force-dynamic'' to ensure fresh data per request\n\nThis fixes the issue where Commission Breakdown widgets showed $0.00 values\nin production while working correctly in local development.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b43fd198b8d570afa31b14a9f87c382811965b30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/indiebuildinganton-gif/pleeno-monorepo/git/trees/b43fd198b8d570afa31b14a9f87c382811965b30"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/indiebuildinganton-gif/pleeno-monorepo/git/commits/9b1b9eb126c569b4b6798904ca16ad9dbe9078ca","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234336247?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/followers","foll