"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/indiebuildinganton-gif/pleeno-monorepo/commits/9269c775ab249a0ec403ef8082cd18f11aa5420f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-16T02:27:51Z","email":"indiebuildinganton@gmail.com","name":"mystbrent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-16T02:27:51Z","email":"indiebuildinganton@gmail.com","name":"mystbrent"},"message":"Fix: Update Vercel env script to use UAT Supabase and custom domains\n\nCritical fixes to scripts/configure-vercel-env.sh:\n\n1. Supabase Instance Correction:\n   - Changed from old production (iadhxztsuzbkbnhkimqv)\n   - To UAT instance (ccmciliwfdtdspdlkuos)\n   - This matches .env.production and current production deployment\n\n2. App URLs Updated:\n   - Changed from Vercel deployment URLs (*.vercel.app)\n   - To custom domains (*.plenno.com.au)\n   - Ensures environment variables reference actual production URLs\n\n3. Cookie Domain Fixed:\n   - Changed from .vercel.app to .plenno.com.au\n   - Critical for cross-subdomain authentication\n   - Allows cookies to be shared across all *.plenno.com.au subdomains\n\nImpact:\n- Script now configures all 6 Vercel projects with correct credentials\n- Login flow: shell.plenno.com.au/login → dashboard.plenno.com.au/dashboard\n- Auth cookies work across all subdomains (shell, dashboard, agency, entities, payments, reports)\n\nDocumentation:\n- Added VERCEL_ENV_SCRIPT_FIX.md with complete login flow explanation\n- Includes step-by-step verification checklist\n- Documents how to run the script and verify results\n\nRelated commits:\n- bac192d: Fixed cookie domain in api-route.ts\n- 84c1fef: Fixed cookie domain in server.ts\n- d00ed8c: Added UAT Supabase config to .env.production\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"872520f26ff67fd66b8cfe1a50be657d44391f4a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/indiebuildinganton-gif/pleeno-monorepo/git/trees/872520f