Correct cookie domain typo and add domain to remove()\n\nFixes two critical bugs in server.ts cookie handling:\n\n1. Domain typo on line 68: .pleeno.com → .plenno.com.au\n   - Hardcoded fallback had wrong TLD causing cookies to be set\n     with incorrect domain even when COOKIE_DOMAIN env var was set\n\n2. Missing domain attribute in remove() function (lines 92-98)\n   - Cookie removal must use same domain attribute as when set\n   - Added production/development domain configuration matching\n     the pattern used in set() function\n\nImpact:\n- Signup and logout flows use createServerClient from this file\n- Without these fixes, cookies had wrong domain (.pleeno.com)\n- 401 errors persisted because cookies weren''t shared across\n  *.plenno.com.au subdomains\n\nRelated to commit bac192d which fixed api-route.ts for login flow.\nThis completes the cookie domain fix across all auth code paths.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9330d793c70064be09603ee501565eeb35908cba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/indiebuildinganton-gif/pleeno-monorepo/git/trees/9330d793c70064be09603ee501565eeb35908cba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/indiebuildinganton-gif/pleeno-monorepo/git/commits/84c1feff737a9082753ca82e660258fadddd9da8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234336247?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/indiebuildinganton-gif","id":234336247,"login":"indiebuildinganton-gif","node_id":"U_kg