b.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/indiebuildinganton-gif/pleeno-monorepo/commits/bac192deac97bbfc8e6bbd734a308dea3e795b34/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-14T14:02:06Z","email":"indiebuildinganton@gmail.com","name":"mystbrent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-14T14:02:06Z","email":"indiebuildinganton@gmail.com","name":"mystbrent"},"message":"Fix: Set cookie domain for cross-subdomain authentication\n\nUpdated authentication cookie configuration to set domain=.plenno.com.au\nin production environments. This allows cookies set during login at\nshell.plenno.com.au to be shared with all subdomains (dashboard, entities,\npayments, agency, reports).\n\nRoot cause:\n- Login happens at shell.plenno.com.au\n- API routes exist in child apps (dashboard.plenno.com.au/dashboard/api/*)\n- Without domain attribute, cookies scoped to shell subdomain only\n- Browser doesn''t send cookies to other subdomains = 401 errors\n\nChanges:\n- Updated packages/database/src/api-route.ts\n- Modified set() and remove() in createAPIRouteClient\n- Modified set() and remove() in createServerClientForAPI\n- Added domain: process.env.COOKIE_DOMAIN || ''.plenno.com.au'' for production\n- Maintained domain: ''localhost'' for development\n\nNext steps:\n- Add COOKIE_DOMAIN=.plenno.com.au env var to all Vercel projects\n- Redeploy shell app (where login happens)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"147317380daf8337c02b7f85d3a6e991119baa22","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/indiebuildinganton-gif/pleeno-monorepo/git/trees/147317380daf83