app deployment jobs to output\ncustom domain URLs instead of Vercel deployment URLs:\n- Dashboard: https://dashboard.plenno.com.au\n- Entities: https://entities.plenno.com.au\n- Payments: https://payments.plenno.com.au\n- Agency: https://agency.plenno.com.au\n- Reports: https://reports.plenno.com.au\n\nImpact:\n- Shell will receive custom domain URLs at build time\n- Login redirects will now go to custom domains\n- Next.js rewrites will use custom domains\n- No code changes needed in shell app\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6105e7012925158eac2487a0e97660f63915cc85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/indiebuildinganton-gif/pleeno-monorepo/git/trees/6105e7012925158eac2487a0e97660f63915cc85"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/indiebuildinganton-gif/pleeno-monorepo/git/commits/6cfc4081e762b3d4569b8c6831baa4acfaa18e35","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234336247?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/indiebuildinganton-gif","id":234336247,"login":"indiebuildinganton-gif","node_id":"U_kgDODfev9w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/u