ndiebuildinganton-gif/pleeno-monorepo/commits/4036abb677e46f9c0ee6696401e32e51da41b68e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-14T12:46:28Z","email":"indiebuildinganton@gmail.com","name":"mystbrent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-14T12:46:28Z","email":"indiebuildinganton@gmail.com","name":"mystbrent"},"message":"Fix: Explicitly assign custom domains in deployment workflow\n\nRoot cause: Vercel custom domains not auto-updating to latest deployments\nbecause workflow relied on automatic domain assignment which was failing.\n\nChanges:\n1. Added explicit `vercel alias set` for all 6 apps:\n   - dashboard.plenno.com.au\n   - entities.plenno.com.au\n   - payments.plenno.com.au\n   - agency.plenno.com.au\n   - reports.plenno.com.au\n   - shell.plenno.com.au\n\n2. Removed redundant project configuration PATCH calls:\n   - These were reconfiguring projects on every deployment\n   - May have interfered with domain assignments\n   - Projects should be configured once in Vercel Dashboard\n\nImpact:\n- Custom domains will now update to latest deployment automatically\n- Future CI/CD runs will assign custom domains immediately after deploy\n- Users will see latest code on custom domains (not 28-day-old versions)\n\nRefs: docs/deployment/CRITICAL_VERCEL_CONFIG_REQUIRED.md\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4ae968b34f1ad0fea66b31738cd657748f9998d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/indiebuildinganton-gif/pleeno-monorepo/git/trees/4ae968b34f1ad0fea66b31738cd657748f9998d1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/indiebuildinganton-gif/pleeno-monorepo/git/commits/4036abb677e46f9c0ee6696401e32e51da41b68e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234336247?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/events{/priva