//api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/indiebuildinganton-gif","id":234336247,"login":"indiebuildinganton-gif","node_id":"U_kgDODfev9w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/indiebuildinganton-gif/pleeno-monorepo/commits/5d1ddd79095f2342f18bc01807e42d0c3e8c6f2b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-16T03:27:51Z","email":"indiebuildinganton@gmail.com","name":"mystbrent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-16T03:27:51Z","email":"indiebuildinganton@gmail.com","name":"mystbrent"},"message":"Test: Replace all middleware with minimal pass-through version\n\nTemporarily simplified all middleware to basic pass-through to isolate the MIDDLEWARE_INVOCATION_FAILED issue.\n\nThis minimal middleware:\n- Only imports Next.js types (no Supabase)\n- Simply logs and passes through all requests\n- No authentication logic\n- No environment variable access\n\nIf this works, the issue is with Supabase SSR in Edge Runtime.\nIf this still fails, the issue is with middleware configuration or Vercel setup.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0e2b3b7cbaaa1ac15161af4a5c598c9c94bf6069","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/indiebuildinganton-gif/pleeno-monorepo/git/trees/0e2b3b7cbaaa1a