mail.com","name":"mystbrent"},"message":"Fix: Correct indentation in shell middleware.ts\n\nFixed syntax error in shell middleware where the cookies object and entire middleware body had incorrect indentation after adding try-catch wrapper. This was causing the middleware to fail to compile, resulting in MIDDLEWARE_INVOCATION_FAILED errors.\n\nChanges:\n- Properly indented cookies configuration object\n- Properly indented all middleware logic inside try block\n- Ensured all braces match correctly\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a95203cff2997b7b993dda9091401c3bfdabc91c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/indiebuildinganton-gif/pleeno-monorepo/git/trees/a95203cff2997b7b993dda9091401c3bfdabc91c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/indiebuildinganton-gif/pleeno-monorepo/git/commits/06a94b86986e7fd5e476a9a1104943d86fb0970a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234336247?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/indiebuildinganton-gif","id":234336247,"login":"indiebuildinganton-gif","node_id":"U_kgDODfev9w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.co