gif/pleeno-monorepo/commits/aa92b29ba6e7c97e1af4cadc1ed7c91868797a01/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-15T17:49:44Z","email":"indiebuildinganton@gmail.com","name":"mystbrent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-15T17:49:44Z","email":"indiebuildinganton@gmail.com","name":"mystbrent"},"message":"Fix: Wrap all middleware in try-catch to prevent crashes\n\nAdded comprehensive error handling to all middleware files to prevent MIDDLEWARE_INVOCATION_FAILED errors:\n\n1. Wrapped entire middleware function in try-catch\n2. Extract env vars to local variables before checking\n3. Added detailed logging for debugging\n4. Return pass-through response on any error instead of crashing\n\nThis ensures that even if there''s an unexpected error in the middleware (missing env vars, Supabase client issues, etc.), the request will pass through rather than returning a 500 error.\n\nChanges applied to:\n- apps/shell/middleware.ts\n- apps/dashboard/middleware.ts\n- apps/entities/middleware.ts\n- apps/payments/middleware.ts\n- apps/agency/middleware.ts\n- apps/reports/middleware.ts\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8f731835af2a26a3a89fa1d8baa7b950acc52534","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/indiebuildinganton-gif/pleeno-monorepo/git/trees/8f731835af2a26a3a89fa1d8baa7b950acc52534"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/indiebuildinganton-gif/pleeno-monorepo/git/commits/aa92b29ba6e7c97e1af4cadc1ed7c91868797a01","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234336247?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.g