rly with no-op response if variables are missing\n- Removed non-null assertions (!) from environment variable access\n- Created docs/deployment/VERCEL_ENV_SETUP.md with setup instructions\n\nThis allows deployments to succeed even if environment variables aren''t configured yet, while logging errors for debugging.\n\nNext step: Configure NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL and NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY in Vercel project settings.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d253ad21661a435cda7bb839128e854606778e4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/indiebuildinganton-gif/pleeno-monorepo/git/trees/d253ad21661a435cda7bb839128e854606778e4c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/indiebuildinganton-gif/pleeno-monorepo/git/commits/cc0217961c69907997b4d1401a2c526da0430b3c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234336247?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/indiebuildinganton-gif","id":234336247,"login":"indiebuildinganton-gif","node_id":"U_kgDODfev9w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://