rcel build'' step before deployment to generate .vercel/output\ndirectory required by --prebuilt flag. This fixes the deployment error:\n\"no prebuilt output found in .vercel/output\"\n\nChanges:\n- Add \"Build Vercel Output\" step to all deploy jobs in both workflows\n- Production workflow: vercel build --prod\n- Preview workflow: vercel build (preview environment)\n- Applies to all 6 apps: dashboard, entities, payments, agency, reports, shell\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2eb4487ad981af23bc2d8a4a6ea682e5c4eb2896","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/indiebuildinganton-gif/pleeno-monorepo/git/trees/2eb4487ad981af23bc2d8a4a6ea682e5c4eb2896"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/indiebuildinganton-gif/pleeno-monorepo/git/commits/5315ce0ac154f140f0174eb591c7ed3ac63ed85d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234336247?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/indiebuildinganton-gif","id":234336247,"login":"indiebuildinganton-gif","node_id":"U_kgDODfev9w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indiebuildinganton-gif/subscriptions","type":