, appwebtisingsolutions, nikolauswihlidal)\n- Seeded whitelabel (10 lifetime), smartmarketer (31 lifetime/monthly/bundle), and super_admin users\n- All known paying users now have correct user_has_feature() access to their purchased apps\n\nEntitlements package distribution after fix:\n  super_admin:   2\n  whitelabel:   11\n  smartmarketer: 113\n  regular:       47\n  no_access:      0","tree":{"sha":"07676bf3b5127904fa0b8304206f8c85b9fc90b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deangilmoreremix/crm-smartreplit/git/trees/07676bf3b5127904fa0b8304206f8c85b9fc90b3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deangilmoreremix/crm-smartreplit/git/commits/cf8e2f256a874fa88a6c21e946b04af4eb4a7829","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/deangilmoreremix/crm-smartreplit/commit/cf8e2f256a874fa88a6c21e946b04af4eb4a7829","node_id":"C_kwDOQnJw8toAKGNmOGUyZjI1NmE4NzRmYTg4YTZjMjFlOTQ2YjA0YWY0ZWI0YTc4Mjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/deangilmoreremix/crm-smartreplit/commit/4701086c11f5c3edb4ab1e8393252df3e0939b1d","sha":"4701086c11f5c3edb4ab1e8393252df3e0939b1d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deangilmoreremix/crm-smartreplit/commits/4701086c11f5c3edb4ab1e8393252df3e0939b1d"}],"sha":"cf8e2f256a874fa88a6c21e946b04af4eb4a7829","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deangilmoreremix/crm-smartreplit/commits/cf8e2f256a874fa88a6c21e946b04af4eb4a7829"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deangilmoreremix/crm-smartreplit/commits/4701086c11f5c3edb4ab1e8393252df3e0939b1d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-24T21:41:28Z","email":"shasheemoore@Shashees-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Shashee Moore"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-24T21:41:28Z","email":"shasheemoore@Shashees-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Shashee Moore"},"message":"chore(migration): reconcile 39 remote-applied migrations (Apr–May 2026 drift)\n\n- Added placeholder files for migrations that existed on remote Supabase\n  database but were missing from the local supabase/migrations folder.\n- Brings local migration history in sync with production database.\n- Includes migrations for: user app access, AI apps, Stripe columns,\n  onboarding, RLS policies, user roles, super admin grants, and more.\n- Created: 2026-05-24","tree":{"sha":"ed43649bd99ca7b7621a4f588aaee75b636756f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deangilmoreremix/crm-smartreplit/git/trees/ed43649bd99ca7b7621a4f588aaee75b636756f5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deangilmoreremix/crm-smartreplit/git/commits/4701086c11f5c3edb4ab1e8393252df3e0939b1d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/deangilmoreremix/crm-smartreplit/commit/4701086c11f5c3edb4ab1e8393252df3e0939b1d","node_id":"C_kwDOQnJw8toAKDQ3MDEwODZjMTFmNWMzZWRiNGFiMWU4MzkzMjUyZGYzZTA5MzliMWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/deangilmoreremix/crm-smartreplit/commit/fd02fcb2bf6b64208d9f03e1e452571172ca53b7","sha":"fd02fcb2bf6b64208d9f03e1e452571172ca53b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deangilmoreremix/crm-smartreplit/commits/fd02fcb2bf6b64208d9f03e1e452571172ca53b7"}],"sha":"4701086c11f5c3edb4ab1e8393252df3e0939b1d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deangilmoreremix/crm-smartreplit/commits/4701086c11f5c3edb4ab1e8393252df3e0939b1d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deangilmoreremix/crm-smartreplit/commits/fd02fcb2bf6b64208d9f03e1e452571172ca53b7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-23T00:58:47Z","email":"shasheemoore@Shashees-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Shashee Moore"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-23T00:58:47Z","email":"shasheemoore@Shashees-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Shashee Moore"},"message":"fix: eliminate dashboard console errors (render loop + Supabase 400/404) and lock fixes permanently\n\nThree high-visibility errors on dashboard/landing load have been systematically debugged and resolved:\n\n1. \"Maximum update depth exceeded\" (infinite re-render)\n   - Root: DashboardHeader useEffect depended on full Zustand objects (deals, contacts)\n   - Fix: Switched to stable primitive counts + isGeneratingRef guard\n   - Protection: Strong CRITICAL FIX comment block + this commit\n\n2. 400 on POST /auth/v1/token?grant_type=refresh_token\n   - Root: Stale/expired refresh tokens (dev-bypass or real) caused repeated failures\n   - Fix: Explicit refreshSession() with 400/invalid-token detection + one-time cleanup + signOut\n   - Protection: Detailed JSDoc and inline comments\n\n3. 404 on GET /rest/v1/ai_models?select=id&limit=1\n   - Root: Startup probe in supabaseAIService queried a table that exists in schema but not yet in the live DB\n   - Fix: Replaced probe with safe auth.getSession() (table-agnostic)\n   - Protection: Explanatory comment block\n\nAll temporary diagnostic logging has been removed. TypeScript validation passed for the changed files.\n\nA full COMMIT_DOCUMENTATION file was added following project convention.\n\nThese changes are now part of git history and cannot be accidentally lost or reverted without deliberate effort.\n\nCloses the console errors reported on 2026-05-22.","tree":{"sha":"65f41f35e5a9ce7ae941040eac2a54ef41ae6c5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deangilmoreremix/crm-smartreplit/git/trees/65f41f35e5a9ce7ae941040eac2a54ef41ae6c5c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deangilmoreremix/crm-smartreplit/git/commits/fd02fcb2bf6b64208d9f03e1e452571172ca53b7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/deangilmoreremix/crm-smartreplit/commit/fd02fcb2bf6b64208d9f03e1e452571172ca53b7","node_id":"C_kwDOQnJw8toAKGZkMDJmY2IyYmY2YjY0MjA4ZDlmMDNlMWU0NTI1NzExNzJjYTUzYjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/deangilmoreremix/crm-smartreplit/commit/5a3289e818c9