m errors on lines 387-388","tree":{"sha":"c51023091ca7176f32977e2b03b536d3fe036367","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deangilmoreremix/crm-smartreplit/git/trees/c51023091ca7176f32977e2b03b536d3fe036367"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deangilmoreremix/crm-smartreplit/git/commits/99f1a6103b2f5ae343ecba48c765eb7de9d2e2fd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/deangilmoreremix/crm-smartreplit/commit/99f1a6103b2f5ae343ecba48c765eb7de9d2e2fd","node_id":"C_kwDOQnJw8toAKDk5ZjFhNjEwM2IyZjVhZTM0M2VjYmE0OGM3NjVlYjdkZTlkMmUyZmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/deangilmoreremix/crm-smartreplit/commit/6d84f744398fb7f3d037261b9dbc19276b4f55b1","sha":"6d84f744398fb7f3d037261b9dbc19276b4f55b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deangilmoreremix/crm-smartreplit/commits/6d84f744398fb7f3d037261b9dbc19276b4f55b1"}],"sha":"99f1a6103b2f5ae343ecba48c765eb7de9d2e2fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deangilmoreremix/crm-smartreplit/commits/99f1a6103b2f5ae343ecba48c765eb7de9d2e2fd"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deangilmoreremix/crm-smartreplit/commits/6d84f744398fb7f3d037261b9dbc19276b4f55b1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-22T18:06:55Z","email":"shasheemoore@Shashees-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Shashee Moore"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-22T18:06:55Z","email":"shasheemoore@Shashees-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Shashee Moore"},"message":"feat(openclaw): integrate OpenClaw into unified AI key management system\n\nThis completes the Option A integration for OpenClaw - the legacy standalone\nOpenClawSetupModal and broken useOpenClawStatus/useOpenClawSetup hooks are fully\nreplaced with the existing unified AIApiKeySettings system.\n\nChanges:\n- supabase/migrations/20260521_add_openclaw_to_user_api_keys.sql: Add\n  openclaw_api_key, openclaw_model, openclaw_base_url columns to user_api_keys\n  table (migration already pushed to live Supabase)\n- client/src/hooks/useAIApiKeys.ts: Extend ApiConfig for openclaw provider\n- client/src/components/aiIntegration/AIApiKeySettings.tsx: OpenClaw as 3rd\n  provider with preferOpenClawOnOpen prop for targeted trigger flows\n- client/src/App.tsx: Replace OpenClawSetupModal with AIApiKeySettings\n- client/src/components/Dashboard.tsx: Banner opens AIApiKeySettings directly\n- client/src/components/Navbar.tsx: useAIApiKeys replaces useOpenClawStatus\n- client/src/pages/OpenClawPage.tsx: useAIApiKeys replaces useOpenClawStatus\n- server/routes/openclaw.ts: getOpenClawConfigForUser() per-user key lookup\n- Deleted: useOpenClawSetup.ts, useOpenClawStatus.ts, OpenClawSetupModal.tsx\n\nOpenClaw now uses the same infrastructure as OpenAI and Gemini - unified hook,\nunified UI, per-user key storage, server-side key lookup per authenticated user.","tree":{"sha":"62cd0232e9394a54321317b67b1bddd1cb0c7484","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deangilmoreremix/crm-smartreplit/git/trees/62cd0232e9394a54321317b67b1bddd1cb0c7484"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deangilmoreremix/crm-smartreplit/git/commits/6d84f744398fb7f3d037261b9dbc19276b4f55b1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/deangilmoreremix/crm-smartreplit/commit/6d84f744398fb7f3d037261b9dbc19276b4f55b1","node_id":"C_kwDOQnJw8toAKDZkODRmNzQ0Mzk4ZmI3ZjNkMDM3MjYxYjlkYmMxOTI3NmI0ZjU1YjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/deangilmoreremix/crm-smartreplit/commit/481311d80dbfa909e06f476db3ce253aad80b959","sha":"481311d80dbfa909e06f476db3ce253aad80b959","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deangilmoreremix/crm-smartreplit/commits/481311d80dbfa909e06f476db3ce253aad80b959"}],"sha":"6d84f744398fb7f3d037261b9dbc19276b4f55b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deangilmoreremix/crm-smartreplit/commits/6d84f744398fb7f3d037261b9dbc19276b4f55b1"},{"author":null,"commen