onfiguration\n- Added proper cache headers for performance\n\nPhase 2.3: Error Handling Enhancement\n- Updated ModuleFederationContacts with retry logic and user-friendly error messages\n- Updated ModuleFederationPipeline with same error handling pattern\n- Added loading states with progress indicators\n- Added retry buttons with attempt counters\n- Improved fallback components with helpful error explanations\n\nPhase 3: Fullscreen Display\n- Verified dashboard section containers use calc(100vh - 200px)\n- Updated RemoteProductResearchLoader with proper height constraints\n\nCreated MFE_CORS_DEPLOYMENT.md with deployment instructions for the CORS headers\n\nRoot Cause Confirmed: Contacts and Analytics apps missing CORS headers, blocking dynamic imports","tree":{"sha":"dae6ee4290091d8c368bf8cdd7602eedcc84f9db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deangilmoreremix/crm-smartreplit/git/trees/dae6ee4290091d8c368bf8cdd7602eedcc84f9db"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deangilmoreremix/crm-smartreplit/git/commits/8dc832c02dd4a74ce7e0caeb40d7e3b71dd7b4d6","verification":{"payload":"tree dae6ee4290091d8c368bf8cdd7602eedcc84f9db\nparent 64291ab91155c2e8688bac22c9313c867b744f9a\nauthor Dean Gilmore <dean@smartcrm.vip> 1777955485 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1777955485 +0000\n\nfix: implement MFE CORS headers and error handling improvements\n\nPhase 2.1: CORS Headers Fix\n- Created _headers files for contacts-app and analytics-app deployments\n- Added Access-Control-Allow-Origin: * for all .js files\n- Added specific remoteEntry.js CORS configuration\n- Added proper cache headers for performance\n\nPhase 2.3: Error Handling Enhancement\n- Updated ModuleFederationContacts with retry logic and user-friendly error messages\n- Updated ModuleFederationPipeline with same error handling pattern\n- Added loading states with progress indicators\n- Added retry buttons with attempt counters\n- Improved fallback components with helpful error explanations\n\nPhase 3: Fulls