s/deangilmoreremix/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deangilmoreremix/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deangilmoreremix/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deangilmoreremix","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deangilmoreremix/crm-smartreplit/commits/75b0926c8d1de5ded1d12ab67fcd4e9728f1a19e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-29T15:16:58Z","email":"dean@smartcrm.vip","name":"Dean Gilmore"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-29T15:16:58Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(entitlements): integrate Supabase-based feature gating system\n\nImplement complete entitlement gating with database, middleware, and UI integration.\n\n## Database (Supabase)\n- Create user_entitlements table (140 buyers assigned)\n- Create package_features table (feature mappings per package)\n- Add user_has_feature() RPC function for access checks\n- Packages: super_admin(1), whitelabel(10), smartmarketer(125), no_access(4)\n- Feature counts: regular(5), smartmarketer(27), whitelabel(37), super_admin(wildcard)\n\n## Client Integration\n- App.tsx: All routes use featureKey prop on ProtectedRoute\n- ProtectedRoute.tsx: Remove legacy resource/requireProductTier props\n- Navbar.tsx: Replace role checks with entitlement.package and canAccess()\n- RoleBasedAccess.tsx: Delegate to entitlement system, remove productTier fallback\n- EntitlementContext.tsx: Fetch entitlements on login, auto-create regular for new users\n\n## Server Integration\n- Create requireEntitlement(FeatureKey) middleware factory\n- Apply to all API route groups:\n  * /api/openclaw → OPENCLAW\n  * /api/openai/* → AI_TOOLS\n  * /api/billing/* → BUY_CREDITS\n  * /api/themes/* → WHITE_LABEL_CUSTOMIZATION\n  * /api/domains/* → DOMAIN_MANAGEMENT\n  * /api/provisioning/* → PARTNER_ONBOARDING\n  * /api/assets/* → BRAND_ASSET_MANAGEMENT\n  * /api/messaging/* → TEXT_MESSAGES\n  * /api/phone/* → PHONE_SYSTEM\n  * /api/appointments/* → APPOINTMENTS\n  * /api/videos/* → VIDEO_EMAIL\n  * /api/analytics/* → ANALYTICS\n  * /api/admin/* → ADMIN_PANEL (via enhanced requireAdmin)\n- Global requireAuth: block no_access package on all /api/* routes\n- Create server/types/entitlements.ts with FeatureKey constant and UserEntitlement interface\n\n## Verification\n- Build: npm run build ✅ (client + server)\n- Dev server: npm run dev ✅ (starts without errors)\n- Database tests: user_has_feature() returns correct values for all 4 package types\n  * Whitelabel: white_label=true, ai_tools=true, openclaw=false\n  * SmartMarketer: ai_tools=true, white_label=false, openclaw=false\n  * NoAccess: all false\n  * SuperAdmin: all true (wildcard)\n\n## Migration Notes\n- Legacy requireProductTier middleware kept but no longer used (can be removed)\n- No breaking changes to existing API handlers (middleware layer handles gating)\n- user_entitlements.email must match Supabase auth.users.email for linking\n\n## Next Steps (Optional)\n- Stripe webhook: update user_entitlements.package on payment\n- Remove dead code: server/routes.ts, requireProductTier\n- Upgrade UI: show feature comparison page","tree":{"sha":"e3d8fef337f47040390cc1a5138d560010064580","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deangilmoreremix/crm-smartreplit/git/trees/e3d8fef337f47040390cc1a5138d560010064580"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deangilmoreremix/crm-smartreplit/git/commits/75b0926c8d1de5ded1d12ab67fcd4e9728f1a19e","verification":{"payload":"tree e3d8fef337f47040390cc1a5138d560010064580\nparent dd54dfa9381c577ff230091370e0af8b954df246\nauthor Dean Gilmore <dean@smartcrm.vip> 1777475818 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1777475818 +0000\n\nfeat(entitlements): integrate Supabase-based feature gating system\n\nImplement complete entitlement gating with database, middleware, and UI integration.\n\n## Database (Supabase)\n- Create user_entitlements table (140 buyers assigned)\n- Create package_features table (feature mappings per package)\n- Add user_has_feature() RPC function for access checks\n- Packages: super_admin(1), whitelabel(10), smartmarketer(125), no_access(4)\n- Feature counts: regular(5), smartmarketer(27), whitelabel(37), super_admin(wildcard)\n\n## Client Integration\n- App.tsx: All routes use featureKey prop on ProtectedRoute\n- ProtectedRoute.tsx: Remove legacy resource/requireProductTier props\n- Navbar.tsx: Replace role checks with entitlement.package and canAccess()\n- RoleBasedAccess.tsx: Delegate to entitlement system, remove productTier fallback\n- EntitlementContext.tsx: Fetch entitlements on login, auto-create regular for new users\n\n## Server Integration\n- Create requireEntitlement(FeatureKey) middleware factory\n- Apply to all API route groups:\n  * /api/openclaw → OPENCLAW\n  * /api/openai/* → AI_TOOLS\n  * /api/billing/* → BUY_CREDITS\n  * /api/themes/* → WHITE_LABEL_CUSTOMIZATION\n  * /api/domains/* → DOMAIN_MANAGEMENT\n  * /api/provisioning/* → PARTNER_ONBOARDING\n  * /api/assets/* → BRAND_ASSET_MANAGEMENT\n  * /api/messaging/* → TEXT_MESSAGES\n  * /api/phone/* → PHONE_SYSTEM\n  * /api/appointments/* → APPOINTMENTS\n  * /api/videos/* → VIDEO_EMAIL\n  * /api/analytics/* → ANALYTICS\n  * /api/admin/* → ADMIN_PANEL (via enhanced requireAdmin)\n- Global requireAuth: block no_access package on all /api/* routes\n- Create server/types/entitlements.ts with FeatureKey constant and UserEntitlement interface\n\n## Verification\n- Build: npm run build ✅ (client + server)\n- Dev server: npm run dev ✅ (starts without errors)\n- Database tests: user_has_feature() returns correct values for all 4 package types\n  * Whitelabel: white_label=true, ai_tools=true, openclaw=false\n  * SmartMarketer: ai_tools=true, white_label=false, openclaw=false\n  * NoAccess: all false\n  * SuperAdmin: all true (wildcard)\n\n## Migration Notes\n- Legacy requireProductTier middleware kept but no longer used (can be removed)\n-