wing{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deangilmoreremix/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/deangilmoreremix","id":171268075,"login":"deangilmoreremix","node_id":"U_kgDOCjVX6w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deangilmoreremix/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deangilmoreremix/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deangilmoreremix/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deangilmoreremix/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deangilmoreremix/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deangilmoreremix","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deangilmoreremix/crm-smartreplit/commits/4c902e5e2bd917868eb7e145d6a531219fffb83a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-28T15:47:27Z","email":"dean@smartcrm.vip","name":"Dean Gilmore"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-28T15:47:27Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: complete GTM Prompt Library Analytics implementation\n\n## 🎯 GTM Analytics API Implementation\n\n### ✅ Core API Features\n- **Netlify Function**: Complete GTM prompt library analytics API at\n- **7 Action Endpoints**: dashboard, performance, revenue, create_ab_test, get_ab_tests, update_ab_test, track_response\n- **Authentication**: Supabase JWT validation with user-scoped data access\n- **Database Integration**: Full Supabase integration with RLS policies\n\n### ✅ Database Schema\n- **prompt_performance_metrics**: Performance tracking, costs, token usage\n- **prompt_responses**: Quality scores, revenue attribution, response storage\n- **prompt_ab_tests**: A/B testing management with winner determination\n- **Indexes & Constraints**: Optimized queries with proper foreign keys\n- **Row Level Security**: User-scoped data access on all tables\n\n### ✅ Quality Assurance\n- **Unit Tests**: Function structure and error handling validation\n- **TypeScript Types**: Generated types from live database schema\n- **Migration Verification**: All 47+ migrations applied and synced\n- **API Testing**: Direct function logic verification\n\n### ✅ Build & Deployment\n- **Build Scripts**: Added gtm-prompt-library to npm build process\n- **Netlify Deployment**: Function deployed and tested at https://app.smartcrm.vip\n- **Production Ready**: CORS enabled, error handling, security measures\n\n### ✅ Documentation & Planning\n- **API Design Document**: Comprehensive specification in docs/superpowers/specs/\n- **Implementation Plans**: Detailed execution plans and verification steps\n- **Type Definitions**: Auto-generated TypeScript interfaces for all tables\n\n### 🔧 Technical Implementation\n- **ESM Modules**: Modern JavaScript with proper imports/exports\n- **Error Handling**: Comprehensive validation and user-friendly error messages\n- **Performance**: Indexed queries and efficient data structures\n- **Security**: JWT authentication, input validation, SQL injection protection\n\n### 🚀 Production Deployment\n- **Live Endpoint**: https://app.smartcrm.vip/.netlify/functions/gtm-prompt-library\n- **Database**: Fully configured with all schemas and relationships\n- **Monitoring**: Function logs available via Netlify dashboard\n- **Scalability**: Serverless architecture ready for high-volume analytics\n\n## 📊 Analytics Capabilities Now Available\n\n### Dashboard Analytics\n- Total prompts and responses metrics\n- Performance score averages\n- Cost and token usage tracking\n- Recent activity trends\n\n### Performance Analytics\n- Time-range filtering (7d, 30d, 90d)\n- Category-based breakdowns\n- Daily performance trends\n- Token efficiency analysis\n\n### Revenue Analytics\n- Revenue attribution tracking\n- ROI calculations\n- Quality-to-revenue correlation\n- Cost-benefit analysis\n\n### A/B Testing\n- Test creation and management\n- Response tracking and scoring\n- Winner determination\n- Statistical analysis\n\n### Response Tracking\n- Quality score recording\n- Revenue attribution\n- Category classification\n- Performance correlation\n\n## 🔗 Integration Points\n\n- **Frontend**: Ready for dashboard integration via REST API calls\n- **Authentication**: Uses existing Supabase auth system\n- **Database**: Leverages existing user management and profiles\n- **Analytics**: Compatible with existing CRM data structures\n\n## ✅ Verification Status\n\n- ✅ **Build**: Successful compilation and bundling\n- ✅ **Deploy**: Live on Netlify production\n- ✅ **Database**: All schemas applied and verified\n- ✅ **API**: Function endpoints tested and working\n- ✅ **Security**: Authentication and authorization implemented\n- ✅ **Types**: TypeScript definitions generated and validated\n\nThis implementation provides a comprehensive analytics platform for the GTM prompt library, enabling data-driven optimization of AI prompt performance, revenue tracking, and A/B testing capabilities.","tree":{"sha":"7fc6e43fbe429cf5ea424c77a0fa6da3cdb6d995","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deangilmoreremix/crm-smartreplit/git/trees/7fc6e43fbe429cf5ea424c77a0fa6da3cdb6d995"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deangilmoreremix/crm-smartreplit/git/commits/4c902e5e2bd917868eb7e145d6a531219fffb83a","verification":{"payload":"tree 7fc6e43fbe429cf5ea424c77a0fa6da3cdb6d995\nparent c0cb3bc1e78ed8c49e203bd5725c228e3b2552c2\nauthor Dean Gilmore <dean@smartcrm.vip> 1777391247 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1777391247 +0000\n\nfeat: complete GTM Prompt Library Analytics implementation\n\n## 🎯 GTM Analytics API Implementation\n\n### ✅ Core API Features\n- **Netlify Function**: Complete GTM prompt library analytics API at\n- **7 Action Endpoints**: dashboard, performance, revenue, create_ab_test, get_ab_tests, update_ab_test, track_response\n- **Authentication**: Supabase JWT validation with user-scoped data access\n- **Database Integration**: Full Supabase integration with