?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sunepedersen","id":13627762,"login":"sunepedersen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjI3NzYy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tanova-ai/skills-taxonomy/commits/873eca4b8882517a40b79d7cd047586a19345a66/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-12T20:15:41Z","email":"spwitcom@gmail.com","name":"Sune Pedersen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-12T20:15:41Z","email":"spwitcom@gmail.com","name":"Sune Pedersen"},"message":"Remove duplicate reverse transferability mappings (v1.4.8)\n\nCleaned up taxonomy now that transferability is implicitly bidirectional.\n\nRemoved duplicate mappings:\n  - AWS → GCP/Azure (kept GCP/Azure → AWS)\n  - PostgreSQL → MySQL/MongoDB (kept MySQL/MongoDB → PostgreSQL)\n  - Python → Node.js/Java (kept in Node.js/Java)\n  - Java → Node.js (kept Node.js → Java)\n\nResult: 50% less transferability data, same functionality.\n\nThe getTransferability() function now checks both directions automatically,\nso we only need to define each relationship once.\n\nExample: Define GCP→AWS:85%, and AWS→GCP works automatically.\n\nThis makes the taxonomy:\n- Easier to maintain (one mapping vs two)\n- Impossible to have inconsistent bidirectional scores\n- Cleaner and more intuitive\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"73be189bd8793f38e05d95797965a61fcbc53464","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tanova-ai/skills-taxonomy/git/trees/73be189bd8793f38e05d95797965a61fcbc53464"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tanova-ai/skills-taxonomy/git/commits/873eca4b8882517a40b79d7cd047586a19345a66","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13627762?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sunepedersen","id":13627762,"login":"sunepedersen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjI3NzYy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tanova-ai/skills-taxonomy/commit/873eca4b8882517a40b79d7cd047586a19345a66","node_id":"C_kwDOQnhxttoAKDg3M2VjYTRiODg4MjUxN2E0MGI3OWQ3Y2QwNDc1ODZhMTkzNDVhNjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tanova-ai/skills-taxonomy/commit/5a95fe997203d8e156630c6e05b853eda2280984","sha":"5a95fe997203d8e156630c6e05b853eda2280984","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tanova-ai/skills-taxonomy/commits/5a95fe997203d8e156630c6e05b853eda2280984"}],"sha":"873eca4b8882517a40b79d7cd047586a19345a66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tanova-ai/skills-taxonomy/commits/873eca4b8882517a40b79d7cd047586a19345a66"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13627762?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sunepedersen","id":13627762,"login":"sunepedersen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjI3NzYy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tanova-ai/skills-taxonomy/commits/5a95fe997203d8e156630c6e05b853eda2280984/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-12T20:12:54Z","email":"spwitcom@gmail.com","name":"Sune Pedersen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-12T20:12:54Z","email":"spwitcom@gmail.com","name":"Sune Pedersen"},"message":"Add bidirectional transferability for core tech skills (v1.4.7)\n\nFixed asymmetric transferability by adding reverse mappings:\n\nCloud Providers (bidirectional):\n  - AWS ↔ GCP: 85%\n  - AWS ↔ Azure: 85%\n\nDatabases (bidirectional):\n  - PostgreSQL ↔ MySQL: 90%\n  - PostgreSQL ↔ MongoDB: 50%\n\nBackend Languages (bidirectional):\n  - Python ↔ Java: 70%\n  - Python ↔ Node.js: 65%\n  - Java ↔ Node.js: 55%\n\nProblem: Transferability was one-directional. If job required AWS\nand candidate had GCP, no match (even though GCP→AWS existed).\n\nSolution: Add reverse mappings so skills are substitutable in both\ndirections.\n\nImpact: Jobs requiring AWS will now match candidates with GCP/Azure.\nJobs requiring PostgreSQL will match candidates with MySQL. Etc.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"93d8e6997e0e20884b5bd41f97485a2eec57a3b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tanova-ai/skills-taxonomy/git/trees/93d8e6997e0e20884b5bd41f97485a2eec57a3b2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tanova-ai/skills-taxonomy/git/commits/5a95fe997203d8e156630c6e05b853eda2280984","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13627762?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sunepedersen","id":13627762,"login":"sunepedersen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjI3NzYy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tanova-ai/skills-taxonomy/commit/5a95fe997203d8e156630c6e05b853eda2280984","node_id":"C_kwDOQnhxttoAKDVhOTVmZTk5NzIwM2Q4ZTE1NjYzMGM2ZTA1Yjg1M2VkYTIyODA5OD