ow → ML: 85%\n\nModern Frameworks → Modern Stack:\n  - React → Modern Stack: 80%\n  - Vue → Modern Stack: 80%\n  - Node.js → Modern Stack: 75%\n\nThis enables:\n- Candidates with NLP/TensorFlow to match AI/ML requirements\n- Candidates with React/Vue/Node.js to match Modern Stack requirements\n\nBefore: Only Microservices Architecture matched Modern Stack\nAfter: React, Vue, Node.js, Microservices all match\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b85ffd6a6c017b914e442e3b89bcf30eddba7c42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tanova-ai/skills-taxonomy/git/trees/b85ffd6a6c017b914e442e3b89bcf30eddba7c42"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tanova-ai/skills-taxonomy/git/commits/780361470ed4964bab222b60f7f523e708d2bb9f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13627762?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sunepedersen","id":13627762,"login":"sunepedersen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjI3NzYy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tanova-ai/skills-taxonomy/commit/780361470ed4964bab22