→ Modern Stack: 75%\nCloud Architecture → Modern Stack: 85%\n\nProblem: The taxonomy had \"Modern Stack transfers to Microservices\"\nbut not the reverse. When candidates have \"Microservices Architecture\"\nand jobs require \"Modern Stack\", there was no match.\n\nThis bidirectional approach allows:\n- Jobs requiring \"Modern Stack\" match candidates with microservices/cloud\n- Jobs requiring \"Microservices\" match candidates with modern stack experience\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a5556fab4e3d011f11739dfe1bc42200b15f94c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tanova-ai/skills-taxonomy/git/trees/a5556fab4e3d011f11739dfe1bc42200b15f94c4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tanova-ai/skills-taxonomy/git/commits/a2110215e1aa33c9b67d0b8a6224c5b3c56f9a8f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13627762?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sunepedersen","id":13627762,"login":"sunepedersen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjI3NzYy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tanova-ai/skills-taxonomy/commit/a2110215e1aa33c9b67d0b8a6224c5b3c56f9a8f","node_id":"C_kwDOQnhxttoAKGEyMTEwMjE1ZTFhYTMzYzliNjdkMGI4YTYyMjRjNWIzYzU2ZjlhOGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tanova-ai/skills-taxonomy/commit/34459bb0c05081197a2dd3c60b96f07de7c6668e","sha":"34459bb0c05081197a2dd3c60b96f07de7c6668e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tanova-ai/skills-taxonomy/commits/34459bb0c05081197a2dd3c60b96f07de7c6668e"}],"sha":"a2110215e1aa33c9b67d0b8a6224c5b3c56f9a8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tanova-ai/skills-taxonomy/commits/a2110215e1aa33c9b67d0b8a6224c5b3c56f9a8f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13627762?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sunepedersen","id":13627762,"login":"sunepedersen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjI3NzYy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tanova-ai/skills-taxonomy/commits/34459bb0c05081197a2dd3c60b96f07de7c6668e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-12T19:31:11Z","email":"spwitcom@gmail.com","name":"Sune Pedersen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-12T19:31:11Z","email":"spwitcom@gmail.com","name":"Sune Pedersen"},"message":"Add essential skill aliases for common variations (v1.4.3)\n\nAdded 5 carefully selected aliases for common real-world skill variations:\n\nMachine Learning:\n  - AI/ML Integration\n  - AI/ML Platforms\n\nTeam Building:\n  - Engineering Team Building\n\nProduct Management:\n  - Product Development\n\nBusiness Strategy:\n  - Technology Strategy\n\nThese are genuine variations that appear in real CVs and represent the\nsame underlying skill. Unlike v1.4.2 (which we reverted), these aliases:\n- Are commonly used industry terms\n- Represent canonical concepts (not hyper-specific phrasings)\n- Bridge the gap until existing candidates are re-extracted\n\nThis is a pragmatic middle ground:\n- New CVs will use taxonomy-guided extraction (canonical names)\n- Existing CVs will match via these essential aliases\n- Taxonomy stays clean and maintainable\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2fe181b9bdfe6ebce4919ba968de7d87f382b52e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tanova-ai/skills-taxonomy/git/trees/2fe181b9bdfe6ebce4919ba968de7d87f382b52e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tanova-ai/skills-taxonomy/git/commits/34459bb0c05081197a2dd3c60b96f07de7c6668e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13627762?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sunepedersen","id":13627762,"login":"sunepedersen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjI3NzYy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.g