ommits/5e5329d01df7e79ca6909bdce03bcdf000c92b58/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-12T19:15:28Z","email":"spwitcom@gmail.com","name":"Sune Pedersen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-12T19:15:28Z","email":"spwitcom@gmail.com","name":"Sune Pedersen"},"message":"Revert hyper-specific skill aliases (v1.4.2 → v1.4.1)\n\nReverted commit 4f97407 which added 24 hyper-specific aliases like:\n- \"Engineering Team Building & Scaling\"\n- \"AI/ML Integration\"\n- \"Technology Strategy & Roadmaps\"\n\nReason: We''ve fixed the root cause by injecting taxonomy canonical\nnames into CV extraction (see candidate@19a0a58). Future CVs will\nautomatically use canonical names, so we don''t need aliases for every\npossible variation.\n\nKeeping: Core skills and standard aliases from v1.4.0-1.4.1\n- Technical Leadership (with \"Tech Leadership\", \"CTO\", etc.)\n- Team Building (with \"Team Scaling\", \"Hiring\", etc.)\n- Startup Experience, Remote/Async Work, Modern Stack\n\nThis keeps the taxonomy clean and maintainable while the CV extraction\nensures canonical names are used from the start.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"871eeaa5e1c648942b64934ab936dd7a48c56409","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tanova-ai/skills-taxonomy/git/trees/871eeaa5e1c648942b64934ab936dd7a48c56409"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tanova-ai/skills-taxonomy/git/commits/5e5329d01df7e79ca6909bdce03bcdf000c92b58","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13627762?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/gists{/gist