d_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunepedersen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tanova-ai/skills-taxonomy/commits/4f974071ffb6e2f8bc1e78db71cce464dea21fde/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-12T19:06:56Z","email":"spwitcom@gmail.com","name":"Sune Pedersen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-12T19:06:56Z","email":"spwitcom@gmail.com","name":"Sune Pedersen"},"message":"Add skill aliases for better candidate matching (v1.4.2)\n\nAdded 24 new aliases to improve matching of real-world skill variations:\n\nTeam Building:\n  - Engineering Team Building & Scaling\n  - Building & Scaling Teams\n\nTechnical Leadership:\n  - Engineering Leadership, Tech Lead, Technical Lead\n\nTeam Leadership:\n  - Engineering Management, People Leadership\n\nMachine Learning (AI/ML):\n  - AI/ML Integration, AI/ML Platforms\n  - AI for Engineering Productivity\n\nProduct Management:\n  - Product Leadership, Product Development Lifecycle\n\nBusiness Strategy:\n  - Technology Strategy & Roadmaps\n  - Go-to-Market Strategy\n\nRemote/Async Work:\n  - International Team Management\n\nStartup Experience:\n  - Fundraising & Investor Relations\n\nThis fixes Skills Gap Analysis matching for real CVs where skills are\nexpressed differently than canonical names (e.g., \"Engineering Team\nBuilding & Scaling\" now matches \"Team Building\").\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"702ad63a5be434aa078c0f49d8bbb8aa8abca0c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tanova-ai/skills-taxonomy/git/trees/702ad63a5be434aa078c0f49d8bbb8aa8abca0c8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tanova-ai/skills-taxonomy/git/commits/4f974071ffb6e2f8bc1e78db71cce464dea21fde","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"